{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JQKpdjvtChEqcRQiRhLKRx","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t\"use client\";\n2\t\n3\timport { useState, useEffect, useRef, useCallback } from \"react\";\n4\timport Image from \"next/image\";\n5\timport Lightbox from \"yet-another-react-lightbox\";\n6\timport Zoom from \"yet-another-react-lightbox/plugins/zoom\";\n7\timport Counter from \"yet-another-react-lightbox/plugins/counter\";\n8\timport \"yet-another-react-lightbox/styles.css\";\n9\timport \"yet-another-react-lightbox/plugins/counter.css\";\n10\timport {\n11\t  galleryImages,\n12\t  galleryCategories,\n13\t  type GalleryCategoryId,\n14\t  type GalleryImage,\n15\t} from \"@/data/gallery\";\n16\t\n17\tfunction GalleryThumbnail({\n18\t  image,\n19\t  index,\n20\t  onClick,\n21\t}: {\n22\t  image: GalleryImage;\n23\t  index: number;\n24\t  onClick: (index: number) => void;\n25\t}) {\n26\t  return (\n27\t    <button\n28\t      type=\"button\"\n29\t      onClick={() => onClick(index)}\n30\t      className=\"relative aspect-[4/3] rounded-xl overflow-hidden group focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-amber-600\"\n31\t      aria-label={`View photo: ${image.alt}`}\n32\t    >\n33\t      <Image\n34\t        src={image.src}\n35\t        alt={image.alt}\n36\t        fill\n37\t        sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 50vw, (max-width: 1024px) 33vw, 25vw\"\n38\t        className=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105\"\n39\t        loading=\"lazy\"\n40\t      />\n41\t      <div className=\"absolute inset-0 bg-stone-900/0 group-hover:bg-stone-900/20 transition-colors duration-300\" />\n42\t      <div className=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300\">\n43\t        <svg\n44\t          className=\"w-8 h-8 text-white drop-shadow-lg\"\n45\t          fill=\"none\"\n46\t          stroke=\"currentColor\"\n47\t          viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"\n48\t          aria-hidden=\"true\"\n49\t        >\n50\t          <path\n51\t            strokeLinecap=\"round\"\n52\t            strokeLinejoin=\"round\"\n53\t            strokeWidth={2}\n54\t            d=\"M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0zM10 7v3m0 0v3m0-3h3m-3 0H7\"\n55\t          />\n56\t        </svg>\n57\t      </div>\n58\t    </button>\n59\t  );\n60\t}\n61\t\n62\texport default function PhotoGallery() {\n63\t  const [lightboxOpen, setLightboxOpen] = useState(false);\n64\t  const [lightboxIndex, setLightboxIndex] = useState(0);\n65\t  const [activeCategory, setActiveCategory] = useState<GalleryCategoryId>(\"all\");\n66\t  const [isVisible, setIsVisible] = useState(false);\n67\t  const sectionRef = useRef<HTMLElement>(null);\n68\t\n69\t  // Intersection Observer for lazy initialization\n70\t  useEffect(() => {\n71\t    const el = sectionRef.current;\n72\t    if (!el) return;\n73\t\n74\t    const observer = new IntersectionObserver(\n75\t      ([entry]) => {\n76\t        if (entry.isIntersecting) {\n77\t          setIsVisible(true);\n78\t          observer.disconnect();\n79\t        }\n80\t      },\n81\t      { rootMargin: \"200px\" }\n82\t    );\n83\t\n84\t    observer.observe(el);\n85\t    return () => observer.disconnect();\n86\t  }, []);\n87\t\n88\t  const filteredImages =\n89\t    activeCategory === \"all\"\n90\t      ? galleryImages\n91\t      : galleryImages.filter((img) => img.category === activeCategory);\n92\t\n93\t  const lightboxSlides = filteredImages.map((img) => ({\n94\t    src: img.src,\n95\t    alt: img.alt,\n96\t    width: img.width,\n97\t    height: img.height,\n98\t  }));\n99\t\n100\t  const handleThumbnailClick = useCallback((index: number) => {\n101\t    setLightboxIndex(index);\n102\t    setLightboxOpen(true);\n103\t  }, []);\n104\t\n105\t  return (\n106\t    <section\n107\t      ref={sectionRef}\n108\t      className=\"py-16 bg-stone-50 dark:bg-stone-950\"\n109\t      aria-labelledby=\"gallery-heading\"\n110\t    >\n111\t      <div className=\"container-custom\">\n112\t        <div className=\"text-center mb-10\">\n113\t          <p className=\"section-label\">Gallery</p>\n114\t          <h2\n115\t            id=\"gallery-heading\"\n116\t            className=\"section-heading mb-4\"\n117\t          >\n118\t            Explore Our Space\n119\t          </h2>\n120\t          <p className=\"text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto\">\n121\t            Take a closer look at our capsule pods, shared facilities, and\n122\t            everything that makes Pelangi Capsule Hostel feel like home.\n123\t          </p>\n124\t        </div>\n125\t\n126\t        {/* Category filter */}\n127\t        <div\n128\t          className=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2 mb-10\"\n129\t          role=\"tablist\"\n130\t          aria-label=\"Filter gallery by category\"\n131\t        >\n132\t          {galleryCategories.map((cat) => (\n133\t            <button\n134\t              key={cat.id}\n135\t              role=\"tab\"\n136\t              aria-selected={activeCategory === cat.id}\n137\t              onClick={() => setActiveCategory(cat.id)}\n138\t              className={`px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-medium transition-colors focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-amber-600 ${\n139\t                activeCategory === cat.id\n140\t                  ? \"bg-amber-600 text-white\"\n141\t                  : \"bg-white dark:bg-stone-800 text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400 hover:bg-stone-100 dark:hover:bg-stone-700\"\n142\t              }`}\n143\t            >\n144\t              {cat.label}\n145\t            </button>\n146\t          ))}\n147\t        </div>\n148\t\n149\t        {/* Gallery grid */}\n150\t        {isVisible && (\n151\t          <div\n152\t            className=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4\"\n153\t            role=\"tabpanel\"\n154\t            aria-label={`${galleryCategories.find((c) => c.id === activeCategory)?.label} photos`}\n155\t          >\n156\t            {filteredImages.map((image, index) => (\n157\t              <GalleryThumbnail\n158\t                key={image.src}\n159\t                image={image}\n160\t                index={index}\n161\t                onClick={handleThumbnailClick}\n162\t              />\n163\t            ))}\n164\t          </div>\n165\t        )}\n166\t\n167\t        {!isVisible && (\n168\t          <div className=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4\">\n169\t            {Array.from({ length: 8 }).map((_, i) => (\n170\t              <div\n171\t                key={i}\n172\t                className=\"aspect-[4/3] rounded-xl bg-stone-200 dark:bg-stone-800 animate-pulse\"\n173\t              />\n174\t            ))}\n175\t          </div>\n176\t        )}\n177\t      </div>\n178\t\n179\t      {/* Lightbox */}\n180\t      <Lightbox\n181\t        open={lightboxOpen}\n182\t        close={() => setLightboxOpen(false)}\n183\t        index={lightboxIndex}\n184\t        slides={lightboxSlides}\n185\t        plugins={[Zoom, Counter]}\n186\t        animation={{ fade: 300 }}\n187\t        carousel={{ finite: true }}\n188\t        controller={{ closeOnBackdropClick: true }}\n189\t        labels={{\n190\t          Next: \"Next photo\",\n191\t          Previous: \"Previous photo\",\n192\t          Close: \"Close gallery\",\n193\t        }}\n194\t      />\n195\t    </section>\n196\t  );\n197\t}\n198\t\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"68830e82-fc2d-45a4-8eeb-0eb92cc89f20","uuid":"5eb1cc9a-f4b7-449c-bcae-1ba3faefaa6e","timestamp":"2026-04-14T05:02:42.038Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\Jyue\\Documents\\1-projects\\Software Projects\\pelangi-website\\site\\src\\components\\PhotoGallery.tsx","content":"\"use client\";\n\nimport { useState, useEffect, useRef, useCallback } from \"react\";\nimport Image from \"next/image\";\nimport Lightbox from \"yet-another-react-lightbox\";\nimport Zoom from \"yet-another-react-lightbox/plugins/zoom\";\nimport Counter from \"yet-another-react-lightbox/plugins/counter\";\nimport \"yet-another-react-lightbox/styles.css\";\nimport \"yet-another-react-lightbox/plugins/counter.css\";\nimport {\n  galleryImages,\n  galleryCategories,\n  type GalleryCategoryId,\n  type GalleryImage,\n} from \"@/data/gallery\";\n\nfunction GalleryThumbnail({\n  image,\n  index,\n  onClick,\n}: {\n  image: GalleryImage;\n  index: number;\n  onClick: (index: number) => void;\n}) {\n  return (\n    <button\n      type=\"button\"\n      onClick={() => onClick(index)}\n      className=\"relative aspect-[4/3] rounded-xl overflow-hidden group focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-amber-600\"\n      aria-label={`View photo: ${image.alt}`}\n    >\n      <Image\n        src={image.src}\n        alt={image.alt}\n        fill\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 50vw, (max-width: 1024px) 33vw, 25vw\"\n        className=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n      />\n      <div className=\"absolute inset-0 bg-stone-900/0 group-hover:bg-stone-900/20 transition-colors duration-300\" />\n      <div className=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300\">\n        <svg\n          className=\"w-8 h-8 text-white drop-shadow-lg\"\n          fill=\"none\"\n          stroke=\"currentColor\"\n          viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"\n          aria-hidden=\"true\"\n        >\n          <path\n            strokeLinecap=\"round\"\n            strokeLinejoin=\"round\"\n            strokeWidth={2}\n            d=\"M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0zM10 7v3m0 0v3m0-3h3m-3 0H7\"\n          />\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n    </button>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default function PhotoGallery() {\n  const [lightboxOpen, setLightboxOpen] = useState(false);\n  const [lightboxIndex, setLightboxIndex] = useState(0);\n  const [activeCategory, setActiveCategory] = useState<GalleryCategoryId>(\"all\");\n  const [isVisible, setIsVisible] = useState(false);\n  const sectionRef = useRef<HTMLElement>(null);\n\n  // Intersection Observer for lazy initialization\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const el = sectionRef.current;\n    if (!el) return;\n\n    const observer = new IntersectionObserver(\n      ([entry]) => {\n        if (entry.isIntersecting) {\n          setIsVisible(true);\n          observer.disconnect();\n        }\n      },\n      { rootMargin: \"200px\" }\n    );\n\n    observer.observe(el);\n    return () => observer.disconnect();\n  }, []);\n\n  const filteredImages =\n    activeCategory === \"all\"\n      ? galleryImages\n      : galleryImages.filter((img) => img.category === activeCategory);\n\n  const lightboxSlides = filteredImages.map((img) => ({\n    src: img.src,\n    alt: img.alt,\n    width: img.width,\n    height: img.height,\n  }));\n\n  const handleThumbnailClick = useCallback((index: number) => {\n    setLightboxIndex(index);\n    setLightboxOpen(true);\n  }, []);\n\n  return (\n    <section\n      ref={sectionRef}\n      className=\"py-16 bg-stone-50 dark:bg-stone-950\"\n      aria-labelledby=\"gallery-heading\"\n    >\n      <div className=\"container-custom\">\n        <div className=\"text-center mb-10\">\n          <p className=\"section-label\">Gallery</p>\n          <h2\n            id=\"gallery-heading\"\n            className=\"section-heading mb-4\"\n          >\n            Explore Our Space\n          </h2>\n          <p className=\"text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto\">\n            Take a closer look at our capsule pods, shared facilities, and\n            everything that makes Pelangi Capsule Hostel feel like home.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n        {/* Category filter */}\n        <div\n          className=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2 mb-10\"\n          role=\"tablist\"\n          aria-label=\"Filter gallery by category\"\n        >\n          {galleryCategories.map((cat) => (\n            <button\n              key={cat.id}\n              role=\"tab\"\n              aria-selected={activeCategory === cat.id}\n              onClick={() => setActiveCategory(cat.id)}\n              className={`px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-medium transition-colors focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-amber-600 ${\n                activeCategory === cat.id\n                  ? \"bg-amber-600 text-white\"\n                  : \"bg-white dark:bg-stone-800 text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400 hover:bg-stone-100 dark:hover:bg-stone-700\"\n              }`}\n            >\n              {cat.label}\n            </button>\n          ))}\n        </div>\n\n        {/* Gallery grid */}\n        {isVisible && (\n          <div\n            className=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4\"\n            role=\"tabpanel\"\n            aria-label={`${galleryCategories.find((c) => c.id === activeCategory)?.label} photos`}\n          >\n            {filteredImages.map((image, index) => (\n              <GalleryThumbnail\n                key={image.src}\n                image={image}\n                index={index}\n                onClick={handleThumbnailClick}\n              />\n            ))}\n          </div>\n        )}\n\n        {!isVisible && (\n          <div className=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4\">\n            {Array.from({ length: 8 }).map((_, i) => (\n              <div\n                key={i}\n                className=\"aspect-[4/3] rounded-xl bg-stone-200 dark:bg-stone-800 animate-pulse\"\n              />\n            ))}\n          </div>\n        )}\n      </div>\n\n      {/* Lightbox */}\n      <Lightbox\n        open={lightboxOpen}\n        close={() => setLightboxOpen(false)}\n        index={lightboxIndex}\n        slides={lightboxSlides}\n        plugins={[Zoom, Counter]}\n        animation={{ fade: 300 }}\n        carousel={{ finite: true }}\n        controller={{ closeOnBackdropClick: true }}\n        labels={{\n          Next: \"Next photo\",\n          Previous: \"Previous photo\",\n          Close: \"Close gallery\",\n        }}\n      />\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","numLines":198,"startLine":1,"totalLines":198}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Uoxk1J3PdKTLxFsrpm7aTU","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t\"use client\";\n2\t\n3\timport { useState, useRef, useEffect, useCallback } from \"react\";\n4\timport Image from \"next/image\";\n5\t\n6\tfunction handleActivate(callback: () => void) {\n7\t  return {\n8\t    onClick: callback,\n9\t    onKeyDown: (e: React.KeyboardEvent) => {\n10\t      if (e.key === \"Enter\" || e.key === \" \") {\n11\t        e.preventDefault();\n12\t        callback();\n13\t      }\n14\t    },\n15\t  };\n16\t}\n17\t\n18\texport default function Gallery() {\n19\t  const [selectedImage, setSelectedImage] = useState<string | null>(null);\n20\t  const [activeModal, setActiveModal] = useState<string | null>(null);\n21\t  const [lightboxImages, setLightboxImages] = useState<string[]>([]);\n22\t  const lightboxCloseRef = useRef<HTMLButtonElement>(null);\n23\t  const modalCloseRef = useRef<HTMLButtonElement>(null);\n24\t  const triggerRef = useRef<HTMLElement | null>(null);\n25\t\n26\t  const openLightbox = (src: string, images: string[]) => {\n27\t    triggerRef.current = document.activeElement as HTMLElement;\n28\t    setLightboxImages(images);\n29\t    setSelectedImage(src);\n30\t  };\n31\t\n32\t  const closeLightbox = useCallback(() => {\n33\t    setSelectedImage(null);\n34\t    setLightboxImages([]);\n35\t    triggerRef.current?.focus();\n36\t  }, []);\n37\t\n38\t  const closeModal = useCallback(() => {\n39\t    setActiveModal(null);\n40\t    triggerRef.current?.focus();\n41\t  }, []);\n42\t\n43\t  const navigateLightbox = useCallback((direction: 'prev' | 'next') => {\n44\t    setSelectedImage((prev) => {\n45\t      if (!prev || lightboxImages.length === 0) return prev;\n46\t      const currentIndex = lightboxImages.indexOf(prev);\n47\t      if (currentIndex === -1) return prev;\n48\t      const newIndex = direction === 'prev'\n49\t        ? (currentIndex - 1 + lightboxImages.length) % lightboxImages.length\n50\t        : (currentIndex + 1) % lightboxImages.length;\n51\t      return lightboxImages[newIndex];\n52\t    });\n53\t  }, [lightboxImages]);\n54\t\n55\t  // Lightbox keyboard: Escape, ArrowLeft, ArrowRight\n56\t  useEffect(() => {\n57\t    if (!selectedImage) return;\n58\t    // Focus close button when lightbox opens\n59\t    lightboxCloseRef.current?.focus();\n60\t\n61\t    function handleKeyDown(e: KeyboardEvent) {\n62\t      if (e.key === \"Escape\") {\n63\t        closeLightbox();\n64\t      } else if (e.key === \"ArrowLeft\") {\n65\t        e.preventDefault();\n66\t        navigateLightbox('prev');\n67\t      } else if (e.key === \"ArrowRight\") {\n68\t        e.preventDefault();\n69\t        navigateLightbox('next');\n70\t      }\n71\t    }\n72\t    document.addEventListener(\"keydown\", handleKeyDown);\n73\t    return () => document.removeEventListener(\"keydown\", handleKeyDown);\n74\t  }, [selectedImage, closeLightbox, navigateLightbox]);\n75\t\n76\t  // Modal keyboard: Escape to close\n77\t  useEffect(() => {\n78\t    if (!activeModal) return;\n79\t    modalCloseRef.current?.focus();\n80\t\n81\t    function handleKeyDown(e: KeyboardEvent) {\n82\t      if (e.key === \"Escape\") {\n83\t        closeModal();\n84\t      }\n85\t    }\n86\t    document.addEventListener(\"keydown\", handleKeyDown);\n87\t    return () => document.removeEventListener(\"keydown\", handleKeyDown);\n88\t  }, [activeModal, closeModal]);\n89\t\n90\t  // Hostel photos - best shots\n91\t  const hostelPhotos = [\n92\t    { src: \"/images/living-room.jpeg\", alt: \"Cozy common area and living room at Pelangi Capsule Hostel Johor Bahru\" },\n93\t    { src: \"/images/capsule-1.webp\", alt: \"Japanese-style capsule pod interior with privacy features at budget hostel JB\" },\n94\t    { src: \"/images/entrance.jpeg\", alt: \"Welcoming entrance of Pelangi Capsule Hostel in Taman Pelangi\" },\n95\t    { src: \"/images/exterior.JPG\", alt: \"Pelangi Capsule Hostel building exterior in Johor Bahru Malaysia\" },\n96\t    { src: \"/images/capsule-2.webp\", alt: \"Comfortable premium mattress in affordable hostel pod near Singapore\" },\n97\t    { src: \"/images/toilet.jpg\", alt: \"Clean private bathroom with hot shower at Pelangi Hostel JB\" },\n98\t    { src: \"/images/facility-heater.jpg\", alt: \"24/7 hot water heater facility at budget accommodation Johor Bahru\" },\n99\t    { src: \"/images/sink.jpg\", alt: \"Washing and sink area at Pelangi Capsule Hostel\" },\n100\t    { src: \"/images/capsule-3.webp\", alt: \"Capsule pod amenities including USB charging and ventilation\" },\n101\t    { src: \"/images/facility-shoes-rack.jpg\", alt: \"Organized shoe storage at clean hostel in Taman Pelangi JB\" },\n102\t  ];\n103\t\n104\t  // Guest photos - social proof\n105\t  const guestPhotos = Array.from({ length: 20 }, (_, i) => ({\n106\t    src: `/images/guests/guest-${i + 1}.jpg`,\n107\t    alt: `Happy guest enjoying their stay at Pelangi Capsule Hostel Johor Bahru - photo ${i + 1}`,\n108\t  }));\n109\t\n110\t  // Tourist destinations\n111\t  const destinations = [\n112\t    { src: \"/images/destinations/tioman-island.jpg\", name: \"Tioman Island\", distance: \"4 hours\" },\n113\t    { src: \"/images/destinations/singapore.jpg\", name: \"Singapore\", distance: \"30 min\" },\n114\t    { src: \"/images/destinations/jewel.jpg\", name: \"Jewel Changi\", distance: \"45 min\" },\n115\t    { src: \"/images/destinations/garden-by-the-bay.jpg\", name: \"Gardens by the Bay\", distance: \"1 hour\" },\n116\t    { src: \"/images/destinations/melaka.jpg\", name: \"Melaka\", distance: \"3 hours\" },\n117\t    { src: \"/images/destinations/tanjung-piai-nationa.jpg\", name: \"Tanjung Piai\", distance: \"1.5 hours\" },\n118\t  ];\n119\t\n120\t  const ScrollSection = ({\n121\t    title,\n122\t    subtitle,\n123\t    children,\n124\t    onSeeAll,\n125\t    id\n126\t  }: {\n127\t    title: string;\n128\t    subtitle: string;\n129\t    children: React.ReactNode;\n130\t    onSeeAll?: () => void;\n131\t    id?: string;\n132\t  }) => {\n133\t    const scrollRef = useRef<HTMLDivElement>(null);\n134\t\n135\t    const scroll = (direction: 'left' | 'right') => {\n136\t      if (scrollRef.current) {\n137\t        const scrollAmount = 320;\n138\t        const prefersReducedMotion = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\n139\t        scrollRef.current.scrollBy({\n140\t          left: direction === 'left' ? -scrollAmount : scrollAmount,\n141\t          behavior: prefersReducedMotion ? 'auto' : 'smooth'\n142\t        });\n143\t      }\n144\t    };\n145\t\n146\t    return (\n147\t      <div id={id} className=\"mb-16 scroll-mt-24\">\n148\t        <div className=\"flex items-end justify-between mb-6 px-4 md:px-0\">\n149\t          <div>\n150\t            <h3 className=\"font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl font-medium text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100\">{title}</h3>\n151\t            <p className=\"text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400 text-sm mt-1\">{subtitle}</p>\n152\t          </div>\n153\t          <div className=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n154\t            {onSeeAll && (\n155\t              <button\n156\t                onClick={onSeeAll}\n157\t                className=\"min-h-6 inline-flex items-center text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 hover:text-amber-800 dark:hover:text-amber-300 font-medium text-sm mr-4 cursor-pointer\"\n158\t              >\n159\t                See All →\n160\t              </button>\n161\t            )}\n162\t            <button\n163\t              onClick={() => scroll('left')}\n164\t              className=\"w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-white dark:bg-stone-800 shadow-md flex items-center justify-center\n165\t                       hover:bg-stone-50 dark:hover:bg-stone-700 transition-colors cursor-pointer\"\n166\t              aria-label=\"Previous image\"\n167\t            >\n168\t              <svg className=\"w-5 h-5 text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-300\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n169\t                <path strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\" strokeWidth={2} d=\"M15 19l-7-7 7-7\" />\n170\t              </svg>\n171\t            </button>\n172\t            <button\n173\t              onClick={() => scroll('right')}\n174\t              className=\"w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-white dark:bg-stone-800 shadow-md flex items-center justify-center\n175\t                       hover:bg-stone-50 dark:hover:bg-stone-700 transition-colors cursor-pointer\"\n176\t              aria-label=\"Next image\"\n177\t            >\n178\t              <svg className=\"w-5 h-5 text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-300\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n179\t                <path strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\" strokeWidth={2} d=\"M9 5l7 7-7 7\" />\n180\t              </svg>\n181\t            </button>\n182\t          </div>\n183\t        </div>\n184\t        <div\n185\t          ref={scrollRef}\n186\t          className=\"flex gap-4 overflow-x-auto scrollbar-hide pb-4 px-4 md:px-0 snap-x snap-mandatory\"\n187\t          style={{ scrollbarWidth: 'none', msOverflowStyle: 'none' }}\n188\t        >\n189\t          {children}\n190\t        </div>\n191\t      </div>\n192\t    );\n193\t  };\n194\t\n195\t  return (\n196\t    <section id=\"gallery\" className=\"section-padding bg-stone-50 dark:bg-stone-950\">\n197\t      <div className=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto\">\n198\t        {/* Header */}\n199\t        <div className=\"text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-14 px-4\">\n200\t          <p className=\"section-label\">Gallery</p>\n201\t          <h2 className=\"section-heading mb-6\">Photo Gallery</h2>\n202\t          <p className=\"text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400 text-lg leading-relaxed\">\n203\t            Browse through our hostel, see happy guests, and discover adventures waiting for you.\n204\t          </p>\n205\t        </div>\n206\t\n207\t        {/* Section 1: Our Hostel */}\n208\t        <ScrollSection\n209\t          title=\"Our Hostel\"\n210\t          subtitle=\"Capsules, facilities, and common areas\"\n211\t        >\n212\t          {hostelPhotos.map((photo, index) => (\n213\t            <div\n214\t              key={index}\n215\t              role=\"button\"\n216\t              tabIndex={0}\n217\t              aria-label={`View photo: ${photo.alt}`}\n218\t              className=\"shrink-0 w-72 h-48 md:w-80 md:h-56 relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden\n219\t                       cursor-pointer group snap-start focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-amber-700\"\n220\t              {...handleActivate(() => openLightbox(photo.src, hostelPhotos.map(p => p.src)))}\n221\t            >\n222\t              <Image\n223\t                src={photo.src}\n224\t                alt={photo.alt}\n225\t                fill\n226\t                sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 288px, 320px\"\n227\t                className=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-110\"\n228\t              />\n229\t              <div className=\"absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-t from-stone-900/60 via-transparent to-transparent\n230\t                            opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 group-focus-within:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300\" />\n231\t              <div className=\"absolute bottom-3 left-3 text-white opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 group-focus-within:opacity-100\n232\t                            transition-opacity duration-300\">\n233\t                <p className=\"text-sm font-medium\">{photo.alt}</p>\n234\t              </div>\n235\t            </div>\n236\t          ))}\n237\t        </ScrollSection>\n238\t\n239\t        {/* Section 2: Happy Guests */}\n240\t        <ScrollSection\n241\t          id=\"community\"\n242\t          title=\"Guest Photos\"\n243\t          subtitle=\"Real moments from our community\"\n244\t          onSeeAll={() => { triggerRef.current = document.activeElement as HTMLElement; setActiveModal('guests'); }}\n245\t        >\n246\t          {guestPhotos.slice(0, 12).map((photo, index) => (\n247\t            <div\n248\t              key={index}\n249\t              role=\"button\"\n250\t              tabIndex={0}\n251\t              aria-label={`View guest photo ${index + 1}`}\n252\t              className=\"shrink-0 w-40 h-40 md:w-48 md:h-48 relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden\n253\t                       cursor-pointer group snap-start focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-amber-700\"\n254\t              {...handleActivate(() => openLightbox(photo.src, guestPhotos.map(p => p.src)))}\n255\t            >\n256\t              <Image\n257\t                src={photo.src}\n258\t                alt={photo.alt}\n259\t                fill\n260\t                sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 160px, 192px\"\n261\t                className=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-110\"\n262\t              />\n263\t              <div className=\"absolute inset-0 bg-stone-900/0 group-hover:bg-stone-900/20 transition-colors\" />\n264\t            </div>\n265\t          ))}\n266\t          {/* See more card */}\n267\t          <div\n268\t            role=\"button\"\n269\t            tabIndex={0}\n270\t            aria-label={`View all ${guestPhotos.length} guest photos`}\n271\t            className=\"shrink-0 w-40 h-40 md:w-48 md:h-48 relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden\n272\t                     cursor-pointer group snap-start bg-amber-100 dark:bg-amber-900/30 flex items-center justify-center\n273\t                     focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-amber-700\"\n274\t            {...handleActivate(() => { triggerRef.current = document.activeElement as HTMLElement; setActiveModal('guests'); })}\n275\t          >\n276\t            <div className=\"text-center\">\n277\t              <div className=\"text-3xl font-display font-medium text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400\">+{guestPhotos.length - 12}</div>\n278\t              <div className=\"text-sm text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 mt-1\">more photos</div>\n279\t            </div>\n280\t          </div>\n281\t        </ScrollSection>\n282\t\n283\t        {/* Section 3: Explore from JB */}\n284\t        <ScrollSection\n285\t          title=\"Adventures Await\"\n286\t          subtitle=\"Amazing destinations within reach\"\n287\t        >\n288\t          {destinations.map((dest, index) => (\n289\t            <div\n290\t              key={index}\n291\t              role=\"button\"\n292\t              tabIndex={0}\n293\t              aria-label={`View photo: ${dest.name}`}\n294\t              className=\"shrink-0 w-64 md:w-72 relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden\n295\t                       cursor-pointer group snap-start focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-amber-700\"\n296\t              {...handleActivate(() => openLightbox(dest.src, destinations.map(d => d.src)))}\n297\t            >\n298\t              <div className=\"relative h-44 md:h-52\">\n299\t                <Image\n300\t                  src={dest.src}\n301\t                  alt={dest.name}\n302\t                  fill\n303\t                  sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 256px, 288px\"\n304\t                  className=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-110\"\n305\t                />\n306\t                <div className=\"absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-t from-stone-900/80 via-stone-900/20 to-transparent\" />\n307\t              </div>\n308\t              <div className=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 p-4 text-white\">\n309\t                <h4 className=\"font-semibold text-lg\">{dest.name}</h4>\n310\t                <p className=\"text-sm text-stone-300 flex items-center gap-1 mt-1\">\n311\t                  <svg className=\"w-4 h-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n312\t                    <path strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\" strokeWidth={2}\n313\t                      d=\"M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\" />\n314\t                  </svg>\n315\t                  {dest.distance} from hostel\n316\t                </p>\n317\t              </div>\n318\t            </div>\n319\t          ))}\n320\t        </ScrollSection>\n321\t\n322\t        {/* Video Section */}\n323\t        <div className=\"mt-8 px-4 md:px-0\">\n324\t          <div className=\"text-center mb-8\">\n325\t            <p className=\"text-xs tracking-widest uppercase text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400 mb-2\">Virtual Tour</p>\n326\t            <h3 className=\"font-display text-2xl font-medium text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100\">\n327\t              Watch Our Check-in Guide\n328\t            </h3>\n329\t          </div>\n330\t          <div className=\"relative max-w-3xl mx-auto aspect-video rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl\">\n331\t            <iframe\n332\t              src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/6Ux11oBZaQQ?cc_load_policy=1&cc_lang_pref=en\"\n333\t              title=\"Pelangi Capsule Hostel Check-in Guide\"\n334\t              allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\"\n335\t              allowFullScreen\n336\t              className=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full\"\n337\t            />\n338\t          </div>\n339\t        </div>\n340\t      </div>\n341\t\n342\t      {/* Lightbox */}\n343\t      {selectedImage && (\n344\t        <div\n345\t          role=\"dialog\"\n346\t          aria-label=\"Image lightbox\"\n347\t          aria-modal=\"true\"\n348\t          className=\"fixed inset-0 z-50 bg-stone-900/95 backdrop-blur-xs flex items-center justify-center p-4\"\n349\t          onClick={() => closeLightbox()}\n350\t        >\n351\t          <button\n352\t            ref={lightboxCloseRef}\n353\t            className=\"absolute top-6 right-6 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-white/10 flex items-center justify-center\n354\t                     text-white hover:bg-white/20 transition-colors cursor-pointer\"\n355\t            onClick={() => closeLightbox()}\n356\t            aria-label=\"Close lightbox (Escape)\"\n357\t          >\n358\t            <svg className=\"w-6 h-6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n359\t              <path strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\" strokeWidth={1.5} d=\"M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12\" />\n360\t            </svg>\n361\t          </button>\n362\t          {lightboxImages.length > 1 && (\n363\t            <button\n364\t              className=\"absolute left-4 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-white/10 flex items-center justify-center\n365\t                       text-white hover:bg-white/20 transition-colors cursor-pointer z-10\"\n366\t              onClick={(e) => { e.stopPropagation(); navigateLightbox('prev'); }}\n367\t              aria-label=\"Previous image (Left arrow)\"\n368\t            >\n369\t              <svg className=\"w-6 h-6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n370\t                <path strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\" strokeWidth={2} d=\"M15 19l-7-7 7-7\" />\n371\t              </svg>\n372\t            </button>\n373\t          )}\n374\t          <div className=\"relative w-full max-w-5xl h-[80vh]\" onClick={(e) => e.stopPropagation()}>\n375\t            <Image\n376\t              src={selectedImage}\n377\t              alt=\"Pelangi Capsule Hostel Johor Bahru - Gallery photo view\"\n378\t              fill\n379\t              sizes=\"100vw\"\n380\t              className=\"object-contain\"\n381\t            />\n382\t          </div>\n383\t          {lightboxImages.length > 1 && (\n384\t            <button\n385\t              className=\"absolute right-4 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-white/10 flex items-center justify-center\n386\t                       text-white hover:bg-white/20 transition-colors cursor-pointer z-10\"\n387\t              onClick={(e) => { e.stopPropagation(); navigateLightbox('next'); }}\n388\t              aria-label=\"Next image (Right arrow)\"\n389\t            >\n390\t              <svg className=\"w-6 h-6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n391\t                <path strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\" strokeWidth={2} d=\"M9 5l7 7-7 7\" />\n392\t              </svg>\n393\t            </button>\n394\t          )}\n395\t        </div>\n396\t      )}\n397\t\n398\t      {/* All Guests Modal */}\n399\t      {activeModal === 'guests' && (\n400\t        <div\n401\t          role=\"dialog\"\n402\t          aria-label=\"All guest photos\"\n403\t          aria-modal=\"true\"\n404\t          className=\"fixed inset-0 z-50 bg-stone-900/95 backdrop-blur-xs overflow-y-auto\"\n405\t          onClick={() => closeModal()}\n406\t        >\n407\t          <div className=\"min-h-screen p-4 md:p-8\">\n408\t            <div className=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto\">\n409\t              <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-8 sticky top-0 bg-stone-900/80 backdrop-blur-xs py-4 -mx-4 px-4\">\n410\t                <div>\n411\t                  <h3 className=\"text-2xl font-display font-medium text-white\">Guest Photos</h3>\n412\t                  <p className=\"text-stone-400 text-sm\">{guestPhotos.length} photos from our community</p>\n413\t                </div>\n414\t                <button\n415\t                  ref={modalCloseRef}\n416\t                  className=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-white/10 flex items-center justify-center\n417\t                           text-white hover:bg-white/20 transition-colors cursor-pointer\"\n418\t                  onClick={() => closeModal()}\n419\t                  aria-label=\"Close guest photos gallery (Escape)\"\n420\t                >\n421\t                  <svg className=\"w-6 h-6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n422\t                    <path strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\" strokeWidth={1.5} d=\"M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12\" />\n423\t                  </svg>\n424\t                </button>\n425\t              </div>\n426\t              <div\n427\t                className=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-3\"\n428\t                onClick={(e) => e.stopPropagation()}\n429\t              >\n430\t                {guestPhotos.map((photo, index) => (\n431\t                  <div\n432\t                    key={index}\n433\t                    role=\"button\"\n434\t                    tabIndex={0}\n435\t                    aria-label={`View guest photo ${index + 1}`}\n436\t                    className=\"relative aspect-square rounded-xl overflow-hidden cursor-pointer group\n437\t                             focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-amber-700\"\n438\t                    {...handleActivate(() => {\n439\t                      closeModal();\n440\t                      openLightbox(photo.src, guestPhotos.map(p => p.src));\n441\t                    })}\n442\t                  >\n443\t                    <Image\n444\t                      src={photo.src}\n445\t                      alt={photo.alt}\n446\t                      fill\n447\t                      sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 50vw, (max-width: 1024px) 25vw, 20vw\"\n448\t                      className=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-110\"\n449\t                    />\n450\t                    <div className=\"absolute inset-0 bg-stone-900/0 group-hover:bg-stone-900/30 transition-colors\" />\n451\t                  </div>\n452\t                ))}\n453\t              </div>\n454\t            </div>\n455\t          </div>\n456\t        </div>\n457\t      )}\n458\t    </section>\n459\t  );\n460\t}\n461\t\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"68830e82-fc2d-45a4-8eeb-0eb92cc89f20","uuid":"44fd56c6-5cf5-4f22-a1e1-f905f2bf0c6f","timestamp":"2026-04-14T05:02:42.282Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\Jyue\\Documents\\1-projects\\Software Projects\\pelangi-website\\site\\src\\components\\Gallery.tsx","content":"\"use client\";\n\nimport { useState, useRef, useEffect, useCallback } from \"react\";\nimport Image from \"next/image\";\n\nfunction handleActivate(callback: () => void) {\n  return {\n    onClick: callback,\n    onKeyDown: (e: React.KeyboardEvent) => {\n      if (e.key === \"Enter\" || e.key === \" \") {\n        e.preventDefault();\n        callback();\n      }\n    },\n  };\n}\n\nexport default function Gallery() {\n  const [selectedImage, setSelectedImage] = useState<string | null>(null);\n  const [activeModal, setActiveModal] = useState<string | null>(null);\n  const [lightboxImages, setLightboxImages] = useState<string[]>([]);\n  const lightboxCloseRef = useRef<HTMLButtonElement>(null);\n  const modalCloseRef = useRef<HTMLButtonElement>(null);\n  const triggerRef = useRef<HTMLElement | null>(null);\n\n  const openLightbox = (src: string, images: string[]) => {\n    triggerRef.current = document.activeElement as HTMLElement;\n    setLightboxImages(images);\n    setSelectedImage(src);\n  };\n\n  const closeLightbox = useCallback(() => {\n    setSelectedImage(null);\n    setLightboxImages([]);\n    triggerRef.current?.focus();\n  }, []);\n\n  const closeModal = useCallback(() => {\n    setActiveModal(null);\n    triggerRef.current?.focus();\n  }, []);\n\n  const navigateLightbox = useCallback((direction: 'prev' | 'next') => {\n    setSelectedImage((prev) => {\n      if (!prev || lightboxImages.length === 0) return prev;\n      const currentIndex = lightboxImages.indexOf(prev);\n      if (currentIndex === -1) return prev;\n      const newIndex = direction === 'prev'\n        ? (currentIndex - 1 + lightboxImages.length) % lightboxImages.length\n        : (currentIndex + 1) % lightboxImages.length;\n      return lightboxImages[newIndex];\n    });\n  }, [lightboxImages]);\n\n  // Lightbox keyboard: Escape, ArrowLeft, ArrowRight\n  useEffect(() => {\n    if (!selectedImage) return;\n    // Focus close button when lightbox opens\n    lightboxCloseRef.current?.focus();\n\n    function handleKeyDown(e: KeyboardEvent) {\n      if (e.key === \"Escape\") {\n        closeLightbox();\n      } else if (e.key === \"ArrowLeft\") {\n        e.preventDefault();\n        navigateLightbox('prev');\n      } else if (e.key === \"ArrowRight\") {\n        e.preventDefault();\n        navigateLightbox('next');\n      }\n    }\n    document.addEventListener(\"keydown\", handleKeyDown);\n    return () => document.removeEventListener(\"keydown\", handleKeyDown);\n  }, [selectedImage, closeLightbox, navigateLightbox]);\n\n  // Modal keyboard: Escape to close\n  useEffect(() => {\n    if (!activeModal) return;\n    modalCloseRef.current?.focus();\n\n    function handleKeyDown(e: KeyboardEvent) {\n      if (e.key === \"Escape\") {\n        closeModal();\n      }\n    }\n    document.addEventListener(\"keydown\", handleKeyDown);\n    return () => document.removeEventListener(\"keydown\", handleKeyDown);\n  }, [activeModal, closeModal]);\n\n  // Hostel photos - best shots\n  const hostelPhotos = [\n    { src: \"/images/living-room.jpeg\", alt: \"Cozy common area and living room at Pelangi Capsule Hostel Johor Bahru\" },\n    { src: \"/images/capsule-1.webp\", alt: \"Japanese-style capsule pod interior with privacy features at budget hostel JB\" },\n    { src: \"/images/entrance.jpeg\", alt: \"Welcoming entrance of Pelangi Capsule Hostel in Taman Pelangi\" },\n    { src: \"/images/exterior.JPG\", alt: \"Pelangi Capsule Hostel building exterior in Johor Bahru Malaysia\" },\n    { src: \"/images/capsule-2.webp\", alt: \"Comfortable premium mattress in affordable hostel pod near Singapore\" },\n    { src: \"/images/toilet.jpg\", alt: \"Clean private bathroom with hot shower at Pelangi Hostel JB\" },\n    { src: \"/images/facility-heater.jpg\", alt: \"24/7 hot water heater facility at budget accommodation Johor Bahru\" },\n    { src: \"/images/sink.jpg\", alt: \"Washing and sink area at Pelangi Capsule Hostel\" },\n    { src: \"/images/capsule-3.webp\", alt: \"Capsule pod amenities including USB charging and ventilation\" },\n    { src: \"/images/facility-shoes-rack.jpg\", alt: \"Organized shoe storage at clean hostel in Taman Pelangi JB\" },\n  ];\n\n  // Guest photos - social proof\n  const guestPhotos = Array.from({ length: 20 }, (_, i) => ({\n    src: `/images/guests/guest-${i + 1}.jpg`,\n    alt: `Happy guest enjoying their stay at Pelangi Capsule Hostel Johor Bahru - photo ${i + 1}`,\n  }));\n\n  // Tourist destinations\n  const destinations = [\n    { src: \"/images/destinations/tioman-island.jpg\", name: \"Tioman Island\", distance: \"4 hours\" },\n    { src: \"/images/destinations/singapore.jpg\", name: \"Singapore\", distance: \"30 min\" },\n    { src: \"/images/destinations/jewel.jpg\", name: \"Jewel Changi\", distance: \"45 min\" },\n    { src: \"/images/destinations/garden-by-the-bay.jpg\", name: \"Gardens by the Bay\", distance: \"1 hour\" },\n    { src: \"/images/destinations/melaka.jpg\", name: \"Melaka\", distance: \"3 hours\" },\n    { src: \"/images/destinations/tanjung-piai-nationa.jpg\", name: \"Tanjung Piai\", distance: \"1.5 hours\" },\n  ];\n\n  const ScrollSection = ({\n    title,\n    subtitle,\n    children,\n    onSeeAll,\n    id\n  }: {\n    title: string;\n    subtitle: string;\n    children: React.ReactNode;\n    onSeeAll?: () => void;\n    id?: string;\n  }) => {\n    const scrollRef = useRef<HTMLDivElement>(null);\n\n    const scroll = (direction: 'left' | 'right') => {\n      if (scrollRef.current) {\n        const scrollAmount = 320;\n        const prefersReducedMotion = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\n        scrollRef.current.scrollBy({\n          left: direction === 'left' ? -scrollAmount : scrollAmount,\n          behavior: prefersReducedMotion ? 'auto' : 'smooth'\n        });\n      }\n    };\n\n    return (\n      <div id={id} className=\"mb-16 scroll-mt-24\">\n        <div className=\"flex items-end justify-between mb-6 px-4 md:px-0\">\n          <div>\n            <h3 className=\"font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl font-medium text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100\">{title}</h3>\n            <p className=\"text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400 text-sm mt-1\">{subtitle}</p>\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n            {onSeeAll && (\n              <button\n                onClick={onSeeAll}\n                className=\"min-h-6 inline-flex items-center text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 hover:text-amber-800 dark:hover:text-amber-300 font-medium text-sm mr-4 cursor-pointer\"\n              >\n                See All →\n              </button>\n            )}\n            <button\n              onClick={() => scroll('left')}\n              className=\"w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-white dark:bg-stone-800 shadow-md flex items-center justify-center\n                       hover:bg-stone-50 dark:hover:bg-stone-700 transition-colors cursor-pointer\"\n              aria-label=\"Previous image\"\n            >\n              <svg className=\"w-5 h-5 text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-300\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                <path strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\" strokeWidth={2} d=\"M15 19l-7-7 7-7\" />\n              </svg>\n            </button>\n            <button\n              onClick={() => scroll('right')}\n              className=\"w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-white dark:bg-stone-800 shadow-md flex items-center justify-center\n                       hover:bg-stone-50 dark:hover:bg-stone-700 transition-colors cursor-pointer\"\n              aria-label=\"Next image\"\n            >\n              <svg className=\"w-5 h-5 text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-300\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                <path strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\" strokeWidth={2} d=\"M9 5l7 7-7 7\" />\n              </svg>\n            </button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div\n          ref={scrollRef}\n          className=\"flex gap-4 overflow-x-auto scrollbar-hide pb-4 px-4 md:px-0 snap-x snap-mandatory\"\n          style={{ scrollbarWidth: 'none', msOverflowStyle: 'none' }}\n        >\n          {children}\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    );\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <section id=\"gallery\" className=\"section-padding bg-stone-50 dark:bg-stone-950\">\n      <div className=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto\">\n        {/* Header */}\n        <div className=\"text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-14 px-4\">\n          <p className=\"section-label\">Gallery</p>\n          <h2 className=\"section-heading mb-6\">Photo Gallery</h2>\n          <p className=\"text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400 text-lg leading-relaxed\">\n            Browse through our hostel, see happy guests, and discover adventures waiting for you.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n        {/* Section 1: Our Hostel */}\n        <ScrollSection\n          title=\"Our Hostel\"\n          subtitle=\"Capsules, facilities, and common areas\"\n        >\n          {hostelPhotos.map((photo, index) => (\n            <div\n              key={index}\n              role=\"button\"\n              tabIndex={0}\n              aria-label={`View photo: ${photo.alt}`}\n              className=\"shrink-0 w-72 h-48 md:w-80 md:h-56 relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden\n                       cursor-pointer group snap-start focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-amber-700\"\n              {...handleActivate(() => openLightbox(photo.src, hostelPhotos.map(p => p.src)))}\n            >\n              <Image\n                src={photo.src}\n                alt={photo.alt}\n                fill\n                sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 288px, 320px\"\n                className=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-110\"\n              />\n              <div className=\"absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-t from-stone-900/60 via-transparent to-transparent\n                            opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 group-focus-within:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300\" />\n              <div className=\"absolute bottom-3 left-3 text-white opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 group-focus-within:opacity-100\n                            transition-opacity duration-300\">\n                <p className=\"text-sm font-medium\">{photo.alt}</p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          ))}\n        </ScrollSection>\n\n        {/* Section 2: Happy Guests */}\n        <ScrollSection\n          id=\"community\"\n          title=\"Guest Photos\"\n          subtitle=\"Real moments from our community\"\n          onSeeAll={() => { triggerRef.current = document.activeElement as HTMLElement; setActiveModal('guests'); }}\n        >\n          {guestPhotos.slice(0, 12).map((photo, index) => (\n            <div\n              key={index}\n              role=\"button\"\n              tabIndex={0}\n              aria-label={`View guest photo ${index + 1}`}\n              className=\"shrink-0 w-40 h-40 md:w-48 md:h-48 relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden\n                       cursor-pointer group snap-start focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-amber-700\"\n              {...handleActivate(() => openLightbox(photo.src, guestPhotos.map(p => p.src)))}\n            >\n              <Image\n                src={photo.src}\n                alt={photo.alt}\n                fill\n                sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 160px, 192px\"\n                className=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-110\"\n              />\n              <div className=\"absolute inset-0 bg-stone-900/0 group-hover:bg-stone-900/20 transition-colors\" />\n            </div>\n          ))}\n          {/* See more card */}\n          <div\n            role=\"button\"\n            tabIndex={0}\n            aria-label={`View all ${guestPhotos.length} guest photos`}\n            className=\"shrink-0 w-40 h-40 md:w-48 md:h-48 relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden\n                     cursor-pointer group snap-start bg-amber-100 dark:bg-amber-900/30 flex items-center justify-center\n                     focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-amber-700\"\n            {...handleActivate(() => { triggerRef.current = document.activeElement as HTMLElement; setActiveModal('guests'); })}\n          >\n            <div className=\"text-center\">\n              <div className=\"text-3xl font-display font-medium text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400\">+{guestPhotos.length - 12}</div>\n              <div className=\"text-sm text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 mt-1\">more photos</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </ScrollSection>\n\n        {/* Section 3: Explore from JB */}\n        <ScrollSection\n          title=\"Adventures Await\"\n          subtitle=\"Amazing destinations within reach\"\n        >\n          {destinations.map((dest, index) => (\n            <div\n              key={index}\n              role=\"button\"\n              tabIndex={0}\n              aria-label={`View photo: ${dest.name}`}\n              className=\"shrink-0 w-64 md:w-72 relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden\n                       cursor-pointer group snap-start focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-amber-700\"\n              {...handleActivate(() => openLightbox(dest.src, destinations.map(d => d.src)))}\n            >\n              <div className=\"relative h-44 md:h-52\">\n                <Image\n                  src={dest.src}\n                  alt={dest.name}\n                  fill\n                  sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 256px, 288px\"\n                  className=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-110\"\n                />\n                <div className=\"absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-t from-stone-900/80 via-stone-900/20 to-transparent\" />\n              </div>\n              <div className=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 p-4 text-white\">\n                <h4 className=\"font-semibold text-lg\">{dest.name}</h4>\n                <p className=\"text-sm text-stone-300 flex items-center gap-1 mt-1\">\n                  <svg className=\"w-4 h-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                    <path strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\" strokeWidth={2}\n                      d=\"M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\" />\n                  </svg>\n                  {dest.distance} from hostel\n                </p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          ))}\n        </ScrollSection>\n\n        {/* Video Section */}\n        <div className=\"mt-8 px-4 md:px-0\">\n          <div className=\"text-center mb-8\">\n            <p className=\"text-xs tracking-widest uppercase text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400 mb-2\">Virtual Tour</p>\n            <h3 className=\"font-display text-2xl font-medium text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100\">\n              Watch Our Check-in Guide\n            </h3>\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"relative max-w-3xl mx-auto aspect-video rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl\">\n            <iframe\n              src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/6Ux11oBZaQQ?cc_load_policy=1&cc_lang_pref=en\"\n              title=\"Pelangi Capsule Hostel Check-in Guide\"\n              allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\"\n              allowFullScreen\n              className=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full\"\n            />\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      {/* Lightbox */}\n      {selectedImage && (\n        <div\n          role=\"dialog\"\n          aria-label=\"Image lightbox\"\n          aria-modal=\"true\"\n          className=\"fixed inset-0 z-50 bg-stone-900/95 backdrop-blur-xs flex items-center justify-center p-4\"\n          onClick={() => closeLightbox()}\n        >\n          <button\n            ref={lightboxCloseRef}\n            className=\"absolute top-6 right-6 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-white/10 flex items-center justify-center\n                     text-white hover:bg-white/20 transition-colors cursor-pointer\"\n            onClick={() => closeLightbox()}\n            aria-label=\"Close lightbox (Escape)\"\n          >\n            <svg className=\"w-6 h-6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n              <path strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\" strokeWidth={1.5} d=\"M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12\" />\n            </svg>\n          </button>\n          {lightboxImages.length > 1 && (\n            <button\n              className=\"absolute left-4 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-white/10 flex items-center justify-center\n                       text-white hover:bg-white/20 transition-colors cursor-pointer z-10\"\n              onClick={(e) => { e.stopPropagation(); navigateLightbox('prev'); }}\n              aria-label=\"Previous image (Left arrow)\"\n            >\n              <svg className=\"w-6 h-6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                <path strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\" strokeWidth={2} d=\"M15 19l-7-7 7-7\" />\n              </svg>\n            </button>\n          )}\n          <div className=\"relative w-full max-w-5xl h-[80vh]\" onClick={(e) => e.stopPropagation()}>\n            <Image\n              src={selectedImage}\n              alt=\"Pelangi Capsule Hostel Johor Bahru - Gallery photo view\"\n              fill\n              sizes=\"100vw\"\n              className=\"object-contain\"\n            />\n          </div>\n          {lightboxImages.length > 1 && (\n            <button\n              className=\"absolute right-4 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-white/10 flex items-center justify-center\n                       text-white hover:bg-white/20 transition-colors cursor-pointer z-10\"\n              onClick={(e) => { e.stopPropagation(); navigateLightbox('next'); }}\n              aria-label=\"Next image (Right arrow)\"\n            >\n              <svg className=\"w-6 h-6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                <path strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\" strokeWidth={2} d=\"M9 5l7 7-7 7\" />\n              </svg>\n            </button>\n          )}\n        </div>\n      )}\n\n      {/* All Guests Modal */}\n      {activeModal === 'guests' && (\n        <div\n          role=\"dialog\"\n          aria-label=\"All guest photos\"\n          aria-modal=\"true\"\n          className=\"fixed inset-0 z-50 bg-stone-900/95 backdrop-blur-xs overflow-y-auto\"\n          onClick={() => closeModal()}\n        >\n          <div className=\"min-h-screen p-4 md:p-8\">\n            <div className=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto\">\n              <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-8 sticky top-0 bg-stone-900/80 backdrop-blur-xs py-4 -mx-4 px-4\">\n                <div>\n                  <h3 className=\"text-2xl font-display font-medium text-white\">Guest Photos</h3>\n                  <p className=\"text-stone-400 text-sm\">{guestPhotos.length} photos from our community</p>\n                </div>\n                <button\n                  ref={modalCloseRef}\n                  className=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-white/10 flex items-center justify-center\n                           text-white hover:bg-white/20 transition-colors cursor-pointer\"\n                  onClick={() => closeModal()}\n                  aria-label=\"Close guest photos gallery (Escape)\"\n                >\n                  <svg className=\"w-6 h-6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                    <path strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\" strokeWidth={1.5} d=\"M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12\" />\n                  </svg>\n                </button>\n              </div>\n              <div\n                className=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-3\"\n                onClick={(e) => e.stopPropagation()}\n              >\n                {guestPhotos.map((photo, index) => (\n                  <div\n                    key={index}\n                    role=\"button\"\n                    tabIndex={0}\n                    aria-label={`View guest photo ${index + 1}`}\n                    className=\"relative aspect-square rounded-xl overflow-hidden cursor-pointer group\n                             focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-amber-700\"\n                    {...handleActivate(() => {\n                      closeModal();\n                      openLightbox(photo.src, guestPhotos.map(p => p.src));\n                    })}\n                  >\n                    <Image\n                      src={photo.src}\n                      alt={photo.alt}\n                      fill\n                      sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 50vw, (max-width: 1024px) 25vw, 20vw\"\n                      className=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-110\"\n                    />\n                    <div className=\"absolute inset-0 bg-stone-900/0 group-hover:bg-stone-900/30 transition-colors\" />\n                  </div>\n                ))}\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      )}\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","numLines":461,"startLine":1,"totalLines":461}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_017db1nuSzxw59EEtp3ivBFv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good! I found two gallery components:\n1. **Gallery.tsx** - A scroll-based carousel with a lightbox. It has:\n   - ScrollSection component that uses scrollBy() with manual scroll buttons\n   - Lightbox for enlarged viewing\n   - Three galleries: hostel, guests, destinations\n   - Keyboard handling (Arrow keys, Escape)\n   - This is a \"use client\" component with manual scroll logic\n\n2. **PhotoGallery.tsx** - Uses the \"yet-another-react-lightbox\" library\n   - Has category filtering\n   - Uses a Lightbox component for viewing\n   - Intersection Observer for lazy initialization\n   - No carousel/scroll functionality, just grid + lightbox\n\nAccording to the acceptance criteria for US-187, I need to:\n1. Use scroll-snap CSS with ::scroll-button() for prev/next controls\n2. Use ::scroll-marker group for keyboard-accessible dot indicators\n3. Support fallback for non-supporting browsers with @supports query\n4. No layout shift on load (CLS=0)\n\nThe story mentions \"Chrome 135+ (March 2025)\" features with ::scroll-button() and ::scroll-marker pseudo-elements. These are new native CSS features that provide automatic ARIA button roles and keyboard handling, reducing JS dependency.\n\nHowever, I need to understand that:\n- ::scroll-button() is for automatic scroll buttons\n- ::scroll-marker is for navigation dots\n- These are brand new CSS features (Chrome 135+)\n- We need @supports query to guard the declarations\n\nLet me create a plan before implementing.\n\n## Current State Analysis:\n- Gallery.tsx uses manual scroll logic with JavaScript \n- PhotoGallery.tsx uses yet-another-react-lightbox library\n- Both have working carousels but rely on JS\n\n## Problem:\nNeed to refactor carousel(s) to use native CSS scroll-driven features (::scroll-button() and ::scroll-marker) available in Chrome 135+, with fallback for older browsers.\n\n\nMy approach: refactor Gallery.tsx's ScrollSection to leverage CSS scroll-snap with the new pseudo-elements instead of JavaScript scroll handlers. I'll wrap the new CSS declarations in an @supports query to ensure older browsers fall back gracefully. The ::scroll-button() pseudo-element will replace the manual button logic, while ::scroll-marker() will generate the dot indicators automatically. This should eliminate layout shifts and reduce JavaScript complexity.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2442,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7496,"cache_read_input_tokens":55391,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7496},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"68830e82-fc2d-45a4-8eeb-0eb92cc89f20","uuid":"73da8e0d-4bac-4862-9f89-50c3d940a353"}
