{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01W2FC9RKq7bXFqgG2UUnPvs","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t@import 'tailwindcss';\n2\t\n3\t@plugin \"@tailwindcss/typography\";\n4\t\n5\t/* ============================================================\n6\t   CSS @property — Type-safe, animatable design tokens (US-233)\n7\t   Registered custom properties can be interpolated by the browser\n8\t   because their syntax is known (angle, percentage, etc.).\n9\t   Browsers without @property support treat these as untyped\n10\t   custom properties — static fallback values still render correctly,\n11\t   only the animation is lost (progressive enhancement).\n12\t   Chrome 85+, Firefox 128+, Safari 17.2+.\n13\t   ============================================================ */\n14\t@property --gradient-angle {\n15\t  syntax: \"<angle>\";\n16\t  inherits: false;\n17\t  initial-value: 135deg;\n18\t}\n19\t\n20\t@property --divider-progress {\n21\t  syntax: \"<percentage>\";\n22\t  inherits: false;\n23\t  initial-value: 50%;\n24\t}\n25\t\n26\t@theme {\n27\t  --color-primary-50: #faf8f5;\n28\t  --color-primary-100: #f5f0e8;\n29\t  --color-primary-200: #e8ddd0;\n30\t  --color-primary-300: #d4c4ad;\n31\t  --color-primary-400: #bda685;\n32\t  --color-primary-500: #a68b64;\n33\t  --color-primary-600: #8b7355;\n34\t  --color-primary-700: #715d47;\n35\t  --color-primary-800: #5c4c3c;\n36\t  --color-primary-900: #4a3f33;\n37\t\n38\t  --color-accent-50: #fdf8f6;\n39\t  --color-accent-100: #f9ede8;\n40\t  --color-accent-200: #f4dcd3;\n41\t  --color-accent-300: #ecc4b5;\n42\t  --color-accent-400: #e0a48d;\n43\t  --color-accent-500: #d4846a;\n44\t  --color-accent-600: #c26a4f;\n45\t  --color-accent-700: #a25540;\n46\t  --color-accent-800: #864738;\n47\t  --color-accent-900: #6e3d31;\n48\t\n49\t  --color-sand-50: #fafaf9;\n50\t  --color-sand-100: #f5f5f4;\n51\t  --color-sand-200: #e7e5e4;\n52\t  --color-sand-300: #d6d3d1;\n53\t  --color-sand-400: #a8a29e;\n54\t  --color-sand-500: #78716c;\n55\t  --color-sand-600: #57534e;\n56\t  --color-sand-700: #44403c;\n57\t  --color-sand-800: #292524;\n58\t  --color-sand-900: #1c1917;\n59\t\n60\t  --font-sans: var(--font-inter), system-ui, sans-serif;\n61\t  --font-display: var(--font-playfair), Georgia, serif;\n62\t\n63\t  --text-2xs: 0.65rem;\n64\t  --text-2xs--line-height: 1rem;\n65\t\n66\t  --tracking-widest: 0.2em;\n67\t\n68\t  --animate-fade-in: fadeIn 0.6s ease-out forwards;\n69\t  --animate-slide-up: slideUp 0.6s ease-out forwards;\n70\t  --animate-scale-in: scaleIn 0.4s ease-out forwards;\n71\t\n72\t  --background-image-gradient-radial: radial-gradient(var(--tw-gradient-stops));\n73\t  --background-image-noise: url('/images/noise.png');\n74\t\n75\t  @keyframes fadeIn {\n76\t    0% {\n77\t      opacity: 0;\n78\t    }\n79\t    100% {\n80\t      opacity: 1;\n81\t    }\n82\t  }\n83\t  @keyframes slideUp {\n84\t    0% {\n85\t      opacity: 0;\n86\t      transform: translateY(20px);\n87\t    }\n88\t    100% {\n89\t      opacity: 1;\n90\t      transform: translateY(0);\n91\t    }\n92\t  }\n93\t  @keyframes scaleIn {\n94\t    0% {\n95\t      opacity: 0;\n96\t      transform: scale(0.95);\n97\t    }\n98\t    100% {\n99\t      opacity: 1;\n100\t      transform: scale(1);\n101\t    }\n102\t  }\n103\t}\n104\t\n105\t/*\n106\t  The default border color has changed to `currentcolor` in Tailwind CSS v4,\n107\t  so we've added these compatibility styles to make sure everything still\n108\t  looks the same as it did with Tailwind CSS v3.\n109\t\n110\t  If we ever want to remove these styles, we need to add an explicit border\n111\t  color utility to any element that depends on these defaults.\n112\t*/\n113\t@layer base {\n114\t  *,\n115\t  ::after,\n116\t  ::before,\n117\t  ::backdrop,\n118\t  ::file-selector-button {\n119\t    border-color: var(--color-gray-200, currentcolor);\n120\t  }\n121\t}\n122\t\n123\t@utility btn-primary {\n124\t  /* Primary Button - Warm, sophisticated */\n125\t  @apply bg-stone-700 hover:bg-stone-800 text-white font-medium\n126\t           py-3.5 px-8 rounded-full transition-all duration-300\n127\t           shadow-xs hover:shadow-md cursor-pointer\n128\t           tracking-wide text-sm uppercase\n129\t           focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-amber-700\n130\t           dark:bg-stone-200 dark:text-stone-900 dark:hover:bg-stone-100\n131\t           dark:focus-visible:outline-amber-400;\n132\t}\n133\t\n134\t@utility btn-secondary {\n135\t  /* Secondary Button - Minimal outline */\n136\t  @apply bg-transparent hover:bg-stone-100 text-stone-700\n137\t           font-medium py-3.5 px-8 rounded-full\n138\t           border border-stone-500 hover:border-stone-600\n139\t           transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer\n140\t           tracking-wide text-sm uppercase\n141\t           focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-amber-700\n142\t           dark:text-stone-300 dark:border-stone-600 dark:hover:bg-stone-800 dark:hover:border-stone-500\n143\t           dark:focus-visible:outline-amber-400;\n144\t}\n145\t\n146\t@utility section-padding {\n147\t  /* Section spacing - More breathing room */\n148\t  @apply py-20 md:py-28 lg:py-32 px-6 md:px-8;\n149\t}\n150\t\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"68830e82-fc2d-45a4-8eeb-0eb92cc89f20","uuid":"0f3ca934-7907-45a3-903c-7b2eff4f6d0b","timestamp":"2026-04-14T05:02:52.143Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\Jyue\\Documents\\1-projects\\Software Projects\\pelangi-website\\site\\src\\app\\globals.css","content":"@import 'tailwindcss';\n\n@plugin \"@tailwindcss/typography\";\n\n/* ============================================================\n   CSS @property — Type-safe, animatable design tokens (US-233)\n   Registered custom properties can be interpolated by the browser\n   because their syntax is known (angle, percentage, etc.).\n   Browsers without @property support treat these as untyped\n   custom properties — static fallback values still render correctly,\n   only the animation is lost (progressive enhancement).\n   Chrome 85+, Firefox 128+, Safari 17.2+.\n   ============================================================ */\n@property --gradient-angle {\n  syntax: \"<angle>\";\n  inherits: false;\n  initial-value: 135deg;\n}\n\n@property --divider-progress {\n  syntax: \"<percentage>\";\n  inherits: false;\n  initial-value: 50%;\n}\n\n@theme {\n  --color-primary-50: #faf8f5;\n  --color-primary-100: #f5f0e8;\n  --color-primary-200: #e8ddd0;\n  --color-primary-300: #d4c4ad;\n  --color-primary-400: #bda685;\n  --color-primary-500: #a68b64;\n  --color-primary-600: #8b7355;\n  --color-primary-700: #715d47;\n  --color-primary-800: #5c4c3c;\n  --color-primary-900: #4a3f33;\n\n  --color-accent-50: #fdf8f6;\n  --color-accent-100: #f9ede8;\n  --color-accent-200: #f4dcd3;\n  --color-accent-300: #ecc4b5;\n  --color-accent-400: #e0a48d;\n  --color-accent-500: #d4846a;\n  --color-accent-600: #c26a4f;\n  --color-accent-700: #a25540;\n  --color-accent-800: #864738;\n  --color-accent-900: #6e3d31;\n\n  --color-sand-50: #fafaf9;\n  --color-sand-100: #f5f5f4;\n  --color-sand-200: #e7e5e4;\n  --color-sand-300: #d6d3d1;\n  --color-sand-400: #a8a29e;\n  --color-sand-500: #78716c;\n  --color-sand-600: #57534e;\n  --color-sand-700: #44403c;\n  --color-sand-800: #292524;\n  --color-sand-900: #1c1917;\n\n  --font-sans: var(--font-inter), system-ui, sans-serif;\n  --font-display: var(--font-playfair), Georgia, serif;\n\n  --text-2xs: 0.65rem;\n  --text-2xs--line-height: 1rem;\n\n  --tracking-widest: 0.2em;\n\n  --animate-fade-in: fadeIn 0.6s ease-out forwards;\n  --animate-slide-up: slideUp 0.6s ease-out forwards;\n  --animate-scale-in: scaleIn 0.4s ease-out forwards;\n\n  --background-image-gradient-radial: radial-gradient(var(--tw-gradient-stops));\n  --background-image-noise: url('/images/noise.png');\n\n  @keyframes fadeIn {\n    0% {\n      opacity: 0;\n    }\n    100% {\n      opacity: 1;\n    }\n  }\n  @keyframes slideUp {\n    0% {\n      opacity: 0;\n      transform: translateY(20px);\n    }\n    100% {\n      opacity: 1;\n      transform: translateY(0);\n    }\n  }\n  @keyframes scaleIn {\n    0% {\n      opacity: 0;\n      transform: scale(0.95);\n    }\n    100% {\n      opacity: 1;\n      transform: scale(1);\n    }\n  }\n}\n\n/*\n  The default border color has changed to `currentcolor` in Tailwind CSS v4,\n  so we've added these compatibility styles to make sure everything still\n  looks the same as it did with Tailwind CSS v3.\n\n  If we ever want to remove these styles, we need to add an explicit border\n  color utility to any element that depends on these defaults.\n*/\n@layer base {\n  *,\n  ::after,\n  ::before,\n  ::backdrop,\n  ::file-selector-button {\n    border-color: var(--color-gray-200, currentcolor);\n  }\n}\n\n@utility btn-primary {\n  /* Primary Button - Warm, sophisticated */\n  @apply bg-stone-700 hover:bg-stone-800 text-white font-medium\n           py-3.5 px-8 rounded-full transition-all duration-300\n           shadow-xs hover:shadow-md cursor-pointer\n           tracking-wide text-sm uppercase\n           focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-amber-700\n           dark:bg-stone-200 dark:text-stone-900 dark:hover:bg-stone-100\n           dark:focus-visible:outline-amber-400;\n}\n\n@utility btn-secondary {\n  /* Secondary Button - Minimal outline */\n  @apply bg-transparent hover:bg-stone-100 text-stone-700\n           font-medium py-3.5 px-8 rounded-full\n           border border-stone-500 hover:border-stone-600\n           transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer\n           tracking-wide text-sm uppercase\n           focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-amber-700\n           dark:text-stone-300 dark:border-stone-600 dark:hover:bg-stone-800 dark:hover:border-stone-500\n           dark:focus-visible:outline-amber-400;\n}\n\n@utility section-padding {\n  /* Section spacing - More breathing room */\n  @apply py-20 md:py-28 lg:py-32 px-6 md:px-8;\n}\n","numLines":150,"startLine":1,"totalLines":790}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01Azsvwrgcya2ViGNrA2oG3H","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good. Now I have enough context. Let me prepare a plan for implementing US-187:\n\n## Current State\n- Gallery.tsx uses manual JavaScript scroll logic with ScrollSection component\n- Has manual scroll buttons and keyboard handlers  \n- PhotoGallery.tsx uses yet-another-react-lightbox (external library)\n- Both components are Client Components\n\n## Problem\nNeed to refactor carousel to use native CSS scroll-driven features (::scroll-button() and ::scroll-marker) available in Chrome 135+, with @supports fallback for older browsers.\n\n## Plan\nI'll focus on Gallery.tsx ScrollSection since it's the main carousel implementation:\n\n1. **Refactor ScrollSection CSS** to use scroll-snap-type and scroll-snap-align with native ::scroll-button() and ::scroll-marker\n2. **Add @supports query** to guard new pseudo-element declarations  \n3. **Fallback styling** for browsers without support (keep existing scroll behavior)\n4. **Remove JS scroll handlers** where possible (they'll still work as fallback)\n5. **Ensure CLS = 0** by using fixed dimensions\n\nThe key CSS additions:\n```css\n@supports (selector(::scroll-button(*))) {\n  /* New scroll-button styles */\n  [data-carousel-scroll]::scroll-button(prev) {\n    /* styles */\n  }\n  [data-carousel-scroll]::scroll-marker {\n    /* styles */\n  }\n}\n```\n\nFor non-supporting browsers, the existing scrollBy() JS will still work.\n\nLet me implement this.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5129,"cache_read_input_tokens":62887,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5129},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"68830e82-fc2d-45a4-8eeb-0eb92cc89f20","uuid":"09d2c15e-71e8-4acd-a691-f08d6d19efd0"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01Azsvwrgcya2ViGNrA2oG3H","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Current State\n- Gallery.tsx uses a ScrollSection component with manual JavaScript scroll logic and button controls\n- PhotoGallery.tsx uses yet-another-react-lightbox library with grid layout\n- Both are Client Components with keyboard and accessibility support\n\n## Problem Identified  \nNeed to refactor the Gallery.tsx carousel to use native CSS scroll-driven features (::scroll-button() and ::scroll-marker pseudo-elements) available in Chrome 135+, with @supports fallback for older browsers.\n\n## Planned Changes\n- Add native CSS scroll-button/scroll-marker styles to globals.css with @supports guard\n- Create a CSS-native carousel variant with scroll-snap, ::scroll-button, and ::scroll-marker\n- Update Gallery.tsx to use the new CSS pseudo-elements while maintaining JS fallback\n- Ensure Cumulative Layout Shift (CLS) stays at 0 with fixed dimensions\n\n<plan>\n{\n  \"files_to_create\": [],\n  \"files_to_modify\": [\n    \"site/src/app/globals.css\",\n    \"site/src/components/Gallery.tsx\"\n  ],\n  \"functions_to_add\": [],\n  \"estimated_loc\": 120\n}\n</plan>\n\nLet me implement the CSS native scroll-driven carousel refactoring:"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5129,"cache_read_input_tokens":62887,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5129},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"68830e82-fc2d-45a4-8eeb-0eb92cc89f20","uuid":"6ad85327-a36f-4dc4-915e-3435fd9c6847"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01Azsvwrgcya2ViGNrA2oG3H","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01DZKhhsNAxBuCEtRsV3MKWw","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"C:\\Users\\Jyue\\Documents\\1-projects\\Software Projects\\pelangi-website\\site\\src\\app\\globals.css","old_string":"@utility section-padding {\n  /* Section spacing - More breathing room */\n  @apply py-20 md:py-28 lg:py-32 px-6 md:px-8;\n}","new_string":"@utility section-padding {\n  /* Section spacing - More breathing room */\n  @apply py-20 md:py-28 lg:py-32 px-6 md:px-8;\n}\n\n/* ============================================================\n   CSS Native Scroll-Driven Carousel (US-187)\n   Chrome 135+ ships ::scroll-button() and ::scroll-marker\n   pseudo-elements for automatic ARIA button roles and\n   keyboard handling. Fallback: scrollBy() JS continues to work.\n   ============================================================ */\n@supports (selector(::scroll-button(*))) {\n  .carousel-scroll-container {\n    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;\n    scroll-behavior: smooth;\n    overflow-x: auto;\n  }\n\n  .carousel-scroll-container > * {\n    scroll-snap-align: start;\n    scroll-snap-stop: always;\n  }\n\n  /* Automatic scroll prev/next buttons with ARIA roles */\n  .carousel-scroll-container::scroll-button(prev) {\n    @apply w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-white dark:bg-stone-800 shadow-md\n           flex items-center justify-center\n           hover:bg-stone-50 dark:hover:bg-stone-700\n           transition-colors cursor-pointer;\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    top: 50%;\n    transform: translateY(-50%);\n    z-index: 20;\n  }\n\n  .carousel-scroll-container::scroll-button(next) {\n    @apply w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-white dark:bg-stone-800 shadow-md\n           flex items-center justify-center\n           hover:bg-stone-50 dark:hover:bg-stone-700\n           transition-colors cursor-pointer;\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 0;\n    top: 50%;\n    transform: translateY(-50%);\n    z-index: 20;\n  }\n\n  /* Scroll marker group for keyboard-accessible navigation dots */\n  .carousel-scroll-container::scroll-marker {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 0.5rem;\n    justify-content: center;\n    margin-top: 1rem;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n  }\n\n  .carousel-scroll-container::scroll-marker-item {\n    @apply w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-stone-300 dark:bg-stone-600\n           cursor-pointer transition-colors;\n  }\n\n  .carousel-scroll-container::scroll-marker-item[aria-current=\"true\"] {\n    @apply bg-amber-600 dark:bg-amber-400;\n  }\n}\n\n/* Fallback: older browsers degrade to basic scrollable container */\n@supports not (selector(::scroll-button(*))) {\n  .carousel-scroll-container {\n    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;\n    overflow-x: auto;\n    scrollbar-width: none;\n    -ms-overflow-style: none;\n  }\n\n  .carousel-scroll-container::-webkit-scrollbar {\n    display: none;\n  }\n\n  .carousel-scroll-container > * {\n    scroll-snap-align: start;\n    scroll-snap-stop: always;\n  }\n}"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5129,"cache_read_input_tokens":62887,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5129},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"68830e82-fc2d-45a4-8eeb-0eb92cc89f20","uuid":"d3bfc69c-c6ab-48a4-a3c4-06205b185b3d"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DZKhhsNAxBuCEtRsV3MKWw","type":"tool_result","content":"The file C:\\Users\\Jyue\\Documents\\1-projects\\Software Projects\\pelangi-website\\site\\src\\app\\globals.css has been updated successfully."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"68830e82-fc2d-45a4-8eeb-0eb92cc89f20","uuid":"80acbcf8-f772-4e82-9978-433df409e33e","timestamp":"2026-04-14T05:03:06.248Z","tool_use_result":{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\Jyue\\Documents\\1-projects\\Software Projects\\pelangi-website\\site\\src\\app\\globals.css","oldString":"@utility section-padding {\n  /* Section spacing - More breathing room */\n  @apply py-20 md:py-28 lg:py-32 px-6 md:px-8;\n}","newString":"@utility section-padding {\n  /* Section spacing - More breathing room */\n  @apply py-20 md:py-28 lg:py-32 px-6 md:px-8;\n}\n\n/* ============================================================\n   CSS Native Scroll-Driven Carousel (US-187)\n   Chrome 135+ ships ::scroll-button() and ::scroll-marker\n   pseudo-elements for automatic ARIA button roles and\n   keyboard handling. Fallback: scrollBy() JS continues to work.\n   ============================================================ */\n@supports (selector(::scroll-button(*))) {\n  .carousel-scroll-container {\n    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;\n    scroll-behavior: smooth;\n    overflow-x: auto;\n  }\n\n  .carousel-scroll-container > * {\n    scroll-snap-align: start;\n    scroll-snap-stop: always;\n  }\n\n  /* Automatic scroll prev/next buttons with ARIA roles */\n  .carousel-scroll-container::scroll-button(prev) {\n    @apply w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-white dark:bg-stone-800 shadow-md\n           flex items-center justify-center\n           hover:bg-stone-50 dark:hover:bg-stone-700\n           transition-colors cursor-pointer;\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    top: 50%;\n    transform: translateY(-50%);\n    z-index: 20;\n  }\n\n  .carousel-scroll-container::scroll-button(next) {\n    @apply w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-white dark:bg-stone-800 shadow-md\n           flex items-center justify-center\n           hover:bg-stone-50 dark:hover:bg-stone-700\n           transition-colors cursor-pointer;\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 0;\n    top: 50%;\n    transform: translateY(-50%);\n    z-index: 20;\n  }\n\n  /* Scroll marker group for keyboard-accessible navigation dots */\n  .carousel-scroll-container::scroll-marker {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 0.5rem;\n    justify-content: center;\n    margin-top: 1rem;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n  }\n\n  .carousel-scroll-container::scroll-marker-item {\n    @apply w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-stone-300 dark:bg-stone-600\n           cursor-pointer transition-colors;\n  }\n\n  .carousel-scroll-container::scroll-marker-item[aria-current=\"true\"] {\n    @apply bg-amber-600 dark:bg-amber-400;\n  }\n}\n\n/* Fallback: older browsers degrade to basic scrollable container */\n@supports not (selector(::scroll-button(*))) {\n  .carousel-scroll-container {\n    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;\n    overflow-x: auto;\n    scrollbar-width: none;\n    -ms-overflow-style: none;\n  }\n\n  .carousel-scroll-container::-webkit-scrollbar {\n    display: none;\n  }\n\n  .carousel-scroll-container > * {\n    scroll-snap-align: start;\n    scroll-snap-stop: always;\n  }\n}","originalFile":"@import 'tailwindcss';\n\n@plugin \"@tailwindcss/typography\";\n\n/* ============================================================\n   CSS @property — Type-safe, animatable design tokens (US-233)\n   Registered custom properties can be interpolated by the browser\n   because their syntax is known (angle, percentage, etc.).\n   Browsers without @property support treat these as untyped\n   custom properties — static fallback values still render correctly,\n   only the animation is lost (progressive enhancement).\n   Chrome 85+, Firefox 128+, Safari 17.2+.\n   ============================================================ */\n@property --gradient-angle {\n  syntax: \"<angle>\";\n  inherits: false;\n  initial-value: 135deg;\n}\n\n@property --divider-progress {\n  syntax: \"<percentage>\";\n  inherits: false;\n  initial-value: 50%;\n}\n\n@theme {\n  --color-primary-50: #faf8f5;\n  --color-primary-100: #f5f0e8;\n  --color-primary-200: #e8ddd0;\n  --color-primary-300: #d4c4ad;\n  --color-primary-400: #bda685;\n  --color-primary-500: #a68b64;\n  --color-primary-600: #8b7355;\n  --color-primary-700: #715d47;\n  --color-primary-800: #5c4c3c;\n  --color-primary-900: #4a3f33;\n\n  --color-accent-50: #fdf8f6;\n  --color-accent-100: #f9ede8;\n  --color-accent-200: #f4dcd3;\n  --color-accent-300: #ecc4b5;\n  --color-accent-400: #e0a48d;\n  --color-accent-500: #d4846a;\n  --color-accent-600: #c26a4f;\n  --color-accent-700: #a25540;\n  --color-accent-800: #864738;\n  --color-accent-900: #6e3d31;\n\n  --color-sand-50: #fafaf9;\n  --color-sand-100: #f5f5f4;\n  --color-sand-200: #e7e5e4;\n  --color-sand-300: #d6d3d1;\n  --color-sand-400: #a8a29e;\n  --color-sand-500: #78716c;\n  --color-sand-600: #57534e;\n  --color-sand-700: #44403c;\n  --color-sand-800: #292524;\n  --color-sand-900: #1c1917;\n\n  --font-sans: var(--font-inter), system-ui, sans-serif;\n  --font-display: var(--font-playfair), Georgia, serif;\n\n  --text-2xs: 0.65rem;\n  --text-2xs--line-height: 1rem;\n\n  --tracking-widest: 0.2em;\n\n  --animate-fade-in: fadeIn 0.6s ease-out forwards;\n  --animate-slide-up: slideUp 0.6s ease-out forwards;\n  --animate-scale-in: scaleIn 0.4s ease-out forwards;\n\n  --background-image-gradient-radial: radial-gradient(var(--tw-gradient-stops));\n  --background-image-noise: url('/images/noise.png');\n\n  @keyframes fadeIn {\n    0% {\n      opacity: 0;\n    }\n    100% {\n      opacity: 1;\n    }\n  }\n  @keyframes slideUp {\n    0% {\n      opacity: 0;\n      transform: translateY(20px);\n    }\n    100% {\n      opacity: 1;\n      transform: translateY(0);\n    }\n  }\n  @keyframes scaleIn {\n    0% {\n      opacity: 0;\n      transform: scale(0.95);\n    }\n    100% {\n      opacity: 1;\n      transform: scale(1);\n    }\n  }\n}\n\n/*\n  The default border color has changed to `currentcolor` in Tailwind CSS v4,\n  so we've added these compatibility styles to make sure everything still\n  looks the same as it did with Tailwind CSS v3.\n\n  If we ever want to remove these styles, we need to add an explicit border\n  color utility to any element that depends on these defaults.\n*/\n@layer base {\n  *,\n  ::after,\n  ::before,\n  ::backdrop,\n  ::file-selector-button {\n    border-color: var(--color-gray-200, currentcolor);\n  }\n}\n\n@utility btn-primary {\n  /* Primary Button - Warm, sophisticated */\n  @apply bg-stone-700 hover:bg-stone-800 text-white font-medium\n           py-3.5 px-8 rounded-full transition-all duration-300\n           shadow-xs hover:shadow-md cursor-pointer\n           tracking-wide text-sm uppercase\n           focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-amber-700\n           dark:bg-stone-200 dark:text-stone-900 dark:hover:bg-stone-100\n           dark:focus-visible:outline-amber-400;\n}\n\n@utility btn-secondary {\n  /* Secondary Button - Minimal outline */\n  @apply bg-transparent hover:bg-stone-100 text-stone-700\n           font-medium py-3.5 px-8 rounded-full\n           border border-stone-500 hover:border-stone-600\n           transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer\n           tracking-wide text-sm uppercase\n           focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-amber-700\n           dark:text-stone-300 dark:border-stone-600 dark:hover:bg-stone-800 dark:hover:border-stone-500\n           dark:focus-visible:outline-amber-400;\n}\n\n@utility section-padding {\n  /* Section spacing - More breathing room */\n  @apply py-20 md:py-28 lg:py-32 px-6 md:px-8;\n}\n\n@utility container-custom {\n  /* Container */\n  @apply max-w-6xl mx-auto;\n}\n\n@utility section-label {\n  /* Section label - Elegant uppercase */\n  @apply text-xs font-medium tracking-widest uppercase text-amber-700 mb-4 dark:text-amber-400;\n}\n\n@utility section-heading {\n  /* Section heading - Serif display font (uses theme --font-display for next/font metric-adjusted fallback) */\n  @apply text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-medium text-stone-900\n           leading-tight tracking-tight dark:text-stone-100;\n  font-family: var(--font-display);\n}\n\n@utility body-text {\n  /* Body text */\n  @apply text-stone-600 leading-relaxed dark:text-stone-400;\n}\n\n@utility card {\n  /* Card with subtle hover */\n  @apply bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8\n           shadow-xs hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300\n           border border-stone-100\n           dark:bg-stone-800 dark:border-stone-700;\n}\n\n@utility image-frame {\n  /* Image container with elegant corners */\n  @apply rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg;\n}\n\n@utility divider {\n  /* Divider — uses @property --divider-progress for animatable gradient midpoint */\n  height: 1px;\n  background: linear-gradient(\n    to right,\n    transparent,\n    var(--color-stone-200, #e7e5e4) var(--divider-progress, 50%),\n    transparent\n  );\n}\n\n@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n  .divider {\n    background: linear-gradient(\n      to right,\n      transparent,\n      var(--color-stone-700, #44403c) var(--divider-progress, 50%),\n      transparent\n    );\n  }\n}\n\n@utility icon-box {\n  /* Feature icon container */\n  @apply w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 flex items-center justify-center\n           text-amber-700 dark:bg-amber-900/30 dark:text-amber-400;\n}\n\n@utility font-display {\n  /* Display font utility — uses theme variable for next/font metric-adjusted fallback */\n  font-family: var(--font-display);\n}\n\n@utility text-gradient {\n  /* Text gradient — uses @property --gradient-angle for animatable direction */\n  background: linear-gradient(var(--gradient-angle, 135deg), #b45309, #ea580c);\n  -webkit-background-clip: text;\n  -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\n  background-clip: text;\n  color: transparent;\n}\n\n@utility text-gradient-shimmer {\n  /* Animated shimmer variant — rotates gradient angle via @property token */\n  background: linear-gradient(var(--gradient-angle, 135deg), #b45309, #ea580c, #b45309);\n  -webkit-background-clip: text;\n  -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\n  background-clip: text;\n  color: transparent;\n  animation: gradient-shimmer 4s ease-in-out infinite;\n}\n\n@utility image-zoom {\n  /* Smooth image zoom on hover and focus (WCAG 2.1 SC 1.4.13 parity) */\n  @apply transition-transform duration-700 ease-out;\n\n  .group:hover &,\n  .group:focus-within & {\n    @apply scale-105;\n  }\n}\n\n@utility delay-100 {\n  /* Fade in animation delays */\n  animation-delay: 100ms;\n}\n\n@utility delay-200 {\n  animation-delay: 200ms;\n}\n\n@utility delay-300 {\n  animation-delay: 300ms;\n}\n\n@utility delay-400 {\n  animation-delay: 400ms;\n}\n\n@utility scrollbar-hide {\n  /* Hide scrollbar for horizontal scroll sections */\n  -ms-overflow-style: none;\n  scrollbar-width: none;\n\n  &::-webkit-scrollbar {\n    display: none;\n  }\n}\n\n/* CSS Container Query utilities — US-219\n   @supports guard ensures older browsers without CQ support silently ignore\n   container-type and fall back to Tailwind viewport breakpoints (sm:, md:, lg:).\n   Container query units (cqi, cqw) are used here for adaptive label sizing. */\n@supports (container-type: inline-size) {\n  .card-label-cq {\n    /* cqi = 1% of container inline (width) — scales label relative to card width */\n    font-size: clamp(0.75rem, 4.5cqi, 0.875rem);\n    line-height: 1.4;\n  }\n}\n\n@layer base {\n  html {\n    scroll-behavior: smooth;\n    overflow-x: hidden; /* WCAG 2.2 SC 1.4.4 — prevent horizontal scrollbar at 200% zoom */\n  }\n\n  /* Offset sticky header (64px) when scrolling to heading anchors */\n  h2,\n  h3,\n  section[id] {\n    scroll-margin-top: 5rem; /* 80px = 64px header + 16px breathing room */\n  }\n\n  /* US-204: text-wrap: balance prevents awkward single-word orphans on headings.\n     Progressive enhancement — unsupported browsers silently fall back to default wrap.\n     Chrome 114+, Edge 114+, Firefox 121+, Safari 17.4+ */\n  h1,\n  h2,\n  h3 {\n    text-wrap: balance;\n  }\n\n  /* US-204: text-wrap: pretty reduces orphan words in body paragraphs.\n     Uses a lookahead algorithm to avoid lonely single words on the final line.\n     Progressive enhancement — no visual change in unsupported browsers.\n     Chrome 117+, Edge 117+ */\n  p {\n    text-wrap: pretty;\n  }\n\n  /* WCAG 2.2 SC 2.4.11 — prevent MobileBookingBar from obscuring focused elements */\n  @media (max-width: 767px) {\n    html {\n      scroll-padding-bottom: 4rem; /* matches ~64px MobileBookingBar height */\n    }\n  }\n\n  /* WCAG 2.2 SC 2.5.8 — Target Size Minimum: 24×24 CSS px for all interactive elements */\n  /* Inline text links inside .prose are exempt per the inline-text exception */\n  button,\n  [role=\"button\"] {\n    min-height: 1.5rem; /* 24px */\n    min-width: 1.5rem; /* 24px */\n  }\n\n  /* WCAG 2.2 SC 2.4.13 — Focus Appearance: 2px outline, ≥ 3:1 contrast */\n  /* Uses CSS outline (not box-shadow) for Windows High Contrast Mode visibility */\n  :focus-visible {\n    outline: 2px solid var(--color-amber-700, #b45309);\n    outline-offset: 2px;\n  }\n\n  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n    :focus-visible {\n      outline-color: var(--color-amber-400, #fbbf24);\n    }\n  }\n\n  body {\n    @apply antialiased bg-stone-50 text-stone-800 dark:bg-stone-950 dark:text-stone-200;\n    font-feature-settings: \"kern\" 1, \"liga\" 1;\n  }\n\n  /* Elegant selection color */\n  ::selection {\n    background-color: #e8ddd0;\n    color: #4a3f33;\n  }\n\n  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n    ::selection {\n      background-color: #5c4c3c;\n      color: #f5f0e8;\n    }\n  }\n}\n\n/* WCAG 2.1 SC 1.4.10 — Reflow: prose tables scroll horizontally instead of breaking page layout */\n.prose table {\n  display: block;\n  overflow-x: auto;\n  -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\n}\n\n/* WCAG 2.3.3 / WCAG 2.2.2 — Respect prefers-reduced-motion OS preference */\n/* Technique C39: https://www.w3.org/WAI/WCAG22/Techniques/css/C39 */\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n  *, *::before, *::after {\n    animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;\n    animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;\n    transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;\n    scroll-behavior: auto !important;\n  }\n}\n\n/* ============================================================\n   WCAG 2.1 SC 2.2.2 — In-page pause control\n   Pauses all continuous animations when the user activates the\n   PauseAnimationsButton. This is separate from prefers-reduced-motion\n   which only responds to the OS-level preference.\n   ============================================================ */\nhtml.animations-paused *,\nhtml.animations-paused *::before,\nhtml.animations-paused *::after {\n  animation-play-state: paused !important;\n}\n\n/* ============================================================\n   Forced Colors (Windows High Contrast Mode)\n   Ensures all custom-styled interactive elements remain visible\n   when the OS overrides author colors.\n   ============================================================ */\n@media (forced-colors: active) {\n  /* Primary buttons: add explicit border so they remain distinguishable */\n  .btn-primary {\n    border: 2px solid ButtonText;\n    background: ButtonFace;\n    color: ButtonText;\n    forced-color-adjust: none;\n  }\n\n  .btn-primary:hover {\n    background: Highlight;\n    color: HighlightText;\n    border-color: Highlight;\n  }\n\n  /* Secondary buttons: ensure border stays visible */\n  .btn-secondary {\n    border: 2px solid ButtonText;\n    color: ButtonText;\n  }\n\n  .btn-secondary:hover {\n    background: Highlight;\n    color: HighlightText;\n    border-color: Highlight;\n  }\n\n  /* Cards: ensure visible boundary */\n  .card {\n    border: 1px solid CanvasText;\n  }\n\n  /* Icon boxes: add border for visibility without background */\n  .icon-box {\n    border: 1px solid CanvasText;\n  }\n\n  /* Badges (category pills, status indicators): add border so they don't disappear */\n  [class*=\"rounded-full\"][class*=\"bg-amber\"] {\n    border: 1px solid CanvasText;\n    forced-color-adjust: none;\n  }\n\n  /* Focus indicators: ensure outline uses system highlight color */\n  :focus-visible {\n    outline-color: Highlight;\n  }\n\n  /* Icon-only buttons (close, nav arrows): add border for visibility */\n  button:has(> svg:only-child),\n  [role=\"button\"]:has(> svg:only-child) {\n    border: 1px solid ButtonText;\n  }\n\n  /* Dividers: ensure visible in forced-colors */\n  .divider {\n    background: CanvasText;\n  }\n\n  /* Form inputs and textareas: explicit border */\n  input,\n  textarea,\n  select {\n    border: 1px solid ButtonText;\n  }\n\n  /* Links: use system link color */\n  a {\n    color: LinkText;\n  }\n}\n\n/* ============================================================\n   Increased Contrast (macOS \"Increase contrast\" / Windows)\n   Strengthens borders and text contrast for users who opted in.\n   ============================================================ */\n@media (prefers-contrast: more) {\n  /* Form inputs: thicker, darker borders */\n  input,\n  textarea,\n  select {\n    border-width: 2px;\n    border-color: var(--color-stone-700, #44403c);\n  }\n\n  /* Cards: stronger border for visual separation */\n  .card {\n    border-width: 2px;\n    border-color: var(--color-stone-400, #a8a29e);\n  }\n\n  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n    .card {\n      border-color: var(--color-stone-500, #78716c);\n    }\n  }\n\n  /* Dividers: more visible */\n  .divider {\n    height: 2px;\n    opacity: 1;\n  }\n\n  /* Badges: stronger borders */\n  [class*=\"rounded-full\"][class*=\"bg-amber\"] {\n    border: 1px solid var(--color-amber-700, #b45309);\n  }\n\n  /* Icon boxes: add border */\n  .icon-box {\n    border: 1px solid var(--color-amber-600, #d97706);\n  }\n\n  /* Section labels and small text: slightly bolder */\n  .section-label {\n    font-weight: 600;\n  }\n\n  /* Body text: increase contrast */\n  .body-text {\n    color: var(--color-stone-700, #44403c);\n  }\n\n  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n    .body-text {\n      color: var(--color-stone-300, #d6d3d1);\n    }\n  }\n}\n\n/* ============================================================\n   @property-powered keyframe animations (US-233)\n   These animations target @property-registered custom properties,\n   enabling smooth interpolation that would otherwise be impossible\n   with untyped CSS variables.\n   ============================================================ */\n\n/* Rotates gradient angle 135° → 225° → 135° for a subtle shimmer */\n@keyframes gradient-shimmer {\n  0%   { --gradient-angle: 135deg; }\n  50%  { --gradient-angle: 225deg; }\n  100% { --gradient-angle: 135deg; }\n}\n\n/* Sweeps divider gradient midpoint from left to center to right */\n@keyframes divider-sweep {\n  0%   { --divider-progress: 20%; }\n  50%  { --divider-progress: 80%; }\n  100% { --divider-progress: 50%; }\n}\n\n/* Utility class to apply the sweep animation to a divider */\n.divider-animated {\n  animation: divider-sweep 2s ease-in-out forwards;\n}\n\n/* Respect reduced motion */\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n  .text-gradient-shimmer {\n    animation: none;\n  }\n  .divider-animated {\n    animation: none;\n  }\n}\n\n/* ============================================================\n   CSS @starting-style entry animations (US-143)\n   Declarative fade/slide-in for elements entering the DOM.\n   Baseline August 2024: Chrome 117+, Firefox 129+, Safari 17.4+.\n   Uses only opacity + transform (GPU compositor thread, no layout).\n   ============================================================ */\n.entry-fade {\n  opacity: 1;\n  transition: opacity 0.3s ease-out;\n  @starting-style { opacity: 0; }\n}\n\n.entry-zoom-in {\n  opacity: 1;\n  transform: scale(1);\n  transition: opacity 0.25s ease-out, transform 0.25s ease-out;\n  @starting-style { opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.95); }\n}\n\n.entry-fade-up {\n  opacity: 1;\n  transform: translateY(0);\n  transition: opacity 0.3s ease-out, transform 0.3s ease-out;\n  @starting-style { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(1rem); }\n}\n\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n  .entry-fade, .entry-zoom-in, .entry-fade-up { transition: none; }\n}\n\n/* ============================================================\n   Scroll-driven section reveal animations (US-217)\n   Uses animation-timeline: view() for compositor-thread reveals.\n   Only opacity + transform — no layout shifts, no main-thread paint.\n   Gated behind @supports so unsupporting browsers show content normally.\n   ============================================================ */\n@supports (animation-timeline: view()) {\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {\n    @keyframes scroll-fade-in-up {\n      from {\n        opacity: 0;\n        transform: translateY(1.5rem);\n      }\n      to {\n        opacity: 1;\n        transform: translateY(0);\n      }\n    }\n\n    .scroll-reveal {\n      animation: scroll-fade-in-up linear both;\n      animation-timeline: view();\n      animation-range: entry 0% entry 30%;\n    }\n  }\n}\n\n/* ============================================================\n   Cross-document View Transitions (US-197)\n   Opts same-origin hard navigations into a smooth cross-fade\n   via CSS View Transitions Level 2 (@view-transition at-rule).\n   Chrome 126+, Edge 126+, Firefox 144+.\n   Safari degrades gracefully — no transition, no error.\n   Soft navigations (Next.js <Link>) use the JS API separately;\n   this covers direct URL entry, back/forward, and external links.\n   ============================================================ */\n@view-transition {\n  navigation: auto;\n}\n\n::view-transition-old(root) {\n  animation: 200ms ease-out both vt-fade-out;\n}\n\n::view-transition-new(root) {\n  animation: 200ms ease-out both vt-fade-in;\n}\n\n@keyframes vt-fade-out {\n  from { opacity: 1; }\n  to { opacity: 0; }\n}\n\n@keyframes vt-fade-in {\n  from { opacity: 0; }\n  to { opacity: 1; }\n}\n\n/* Disable view transitions when user prefers reduced motion */\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n  @view-transition {\n    navigation: none;\n  }\n}\n\n/* ============================================================\n   Native Popover + CSS Anchor Positioning (US-144)\n   Uses HTML popover attribute for keyboard/focus management\n   and CSS anchor-name / position-anchor for tethering.\n   @supports fallback for browsers without anchor positioning.\n   Chrome 125+, Edge 125+. Safari/Firefox: absolute fallback.\n   ============================================================ */\n.info-popover-anchor {\n  position: relative;\n  display: inline-flex;\n}\n\n.info-popover-trigger {\n  all: unset;\n  display: inline-flex;\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n.info-popover {\n  margin: 0;\n  border: 1px solid var(--color-stone-200, #e7e5e4);\n  border-radius: 0.75rem;\n  padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;\n  background: white;\n  color: var(--color-stone-700, #44403c);\n  font-size: 0.8125rem;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n  max-width: 15rem;\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.08);\n  /* Entry animation */\n  opacity: 1;\n  transition: opacity 0.15s ease-out, transform 0.15s ease-out;\n}\n\n.info-popover:not(:popover-open) {\n  display: none;\n}\n\n/* Anchor positioning (Chrome 125+) */\n@supports (position-anchor: --x) {\n  .info-popover {\n    position: fixed;\n    position-area: block-end span-inline-end;\n    margin-top: 0.375rem;\n  }\n}\n\n/* Fallback for browsers without anchor positioning */\n@supports not (position-anchor: --x) {\n  .info-popover {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: calc(100% + 0.375rem);\n    left: 50%;\n    transform: translateX(-50%);\n  }\n}\n\n@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n  .info-popover {\n    background: var(--color-stone-800, #292524);\n    color: var(--color-stone-200, #e7e5e4);\n    border-color: var(--color-stone-700, #44403c);\n    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.3);\n  }\n}\n\n/* Forced colors: ensure popover border is visible */\n@media (forced-colors: active) {\n  .info-popover {\n    border: 2px solid CanvasText;\n  }\n}\n\n/* Custom scrollbar */\n::-webkit-scrollbar {\n  width: 8px;\n}\n\n::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\n  @apply bg-stone-100;\n}\n\n::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\n  @apply bg-stone-300 rounded-full;\n}\n\n::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {\n  @apply bg-stone-400;\n}\n\n@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n  ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\n    background-color: #1c1917;\n  }\n  ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\n    background-color: #57534e;\n  }\n  ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {\n    background-color: #78716c;\n  }\n}\n\n/* Print styles — booking confirmation and receipt pages */\n@media print {\n  nav,\n  footer,\n  .cookie-banner,\n  .chat-widget,\n  [data-chat-widget],\n  .sticky-booking-bar,\n  [data-cookie-banner] {\n    display: none !important;\n  }\n\n  * {\n    color: #000 !important;\n    background: transparent !important;\n    box-shadow: none !important;\n  }\n\n  body {\n    font-size: 12pt;\n  }\n\n  .booking-summary,\n  [class*=\"booking-summary\"],\n  [class*=\"confirmation\"] {\n    page-break-inside: avoid;\n  }\n}\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":148,"oldLines":6,"newStart":148,"newLines":87,"lines":["   @apply py-20 md:py-28 lg:py-32 px-6 md:px-8;"," }"," ","+/* ============================================================","+   CSS Native Scroll-Driven Carousel (US-187)","+   Chrome 135+ ships ::scroll-button() and ::scroll-marker","+   pseudo-elements for automatic ARIA button roles and","+   keyboard handling. Fallback: scrollBy() JS continues to work.","+   ============================================================ */","+@supports (selector(::scroll-button(*))) {","+  .carousel-scroll-container {","+    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;","+    scroll-behavior: smooth;","+    overflow-x: auto;","+  }","+","+  .carousel-scroll-container > * {","+    scroll-snap-align: start;","+    scroll-snap-stop: always;","+  }","+","+  /* Automatic scroll prev/next buttons with ARIA roles */","+  .carousel-scroll-container::scroll-button(prev) {","+    @apply w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-white dark:bg-stone-800 shadow-md","+           flex items-center justify-center","+           hover:bg-stone-50 dark:hover:bg-stone-700","+           transition-colors cursor-pointer;","+    position: absolute;","+    left: 0;","+    top: 50%;","+    transform: translateY(-50%);","+    z-index: 20;","+  }","+","+  .carousel-scroll-container::scroll-button(next) {","+    @apply w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-white dark:bg-stone-800 shadow-md","+           flex items-center justify-center","+           hover:bg-stone-50 dark:hover:bg-stone-700","+           transition-colors cursor-pointer;","+    position: absolute;","+    right: 0;","+    top: 50%;","+    transform: translateY(-50%);","+    z-index: 20;","+  }","+","+  /* Scroll marker group for keyboard-accessible navigation dots */","+  .carousel-scroll-container::scroll-marker {","+    display: flex;","+    gap: 0.5rem;","+    justify-content: center;","+    margin-top: 1rem;","+    flex-wrap: wrap;","+  }","+","+  .carousel-scroll-container::scroll-marker-item {","+    @apply w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-stone-300 dark:bg-stone-600","+           cursor-pointer transition-colors;","+  }","+","+  .carousel-scroll-container::scroll-marker-item[aria-current=\"true\"] {","+    @apply bg-amber-600 dark:bg-amber-400;","+  }","+}","+","+/* Fallback: older browsers degrade to basic scrollable container */","+@supports not (selector(::scroll-button(*))) {","+  .carousel-scroll-container {","+    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;","+    overflow-x: auto;","+    scrollbar-width: none;","+    -ms-overflow-style: none;","+  }","+","+  .carousel-scroll-container::-webkit-scrollbar {","+    display: none;","+  }","+","+  .carousel-scroll-container > * {","+    scroll-snap-align: start;","+    scroll-snap-stop: always;","+  }","+}","+"," @utility container-custom {","   /* Container */","   @apply max-w-6xl mx-auto;"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_013dKrbBjLnPSFPthexhXnCX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good! Now I need to update the Gallery.tsx component to use the new CSS native scroll-driven carousel. The key changes:\n1. Add `carousel-scroll-container` class to the scroll container\n2. Keep the manual scroll buttons as a fallback for older browsers\n3. Keep the existing keyboard handlers and JS logic\n4. The @supports query will automatically apply the native pseudo-elements in Chrome 135+\n\nThe component should work like this:\n- In Chrome 135+: ::scroll-button() and ::scroll-marker handle the navigation automatically\n- In older browsers: the manual scroll buttons and JS fallback continue to work\n\nLet me update Gallery.tsx now.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1684,"cache_read_input_tokens":68016,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1684},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"68830e82-fc2d-45a4-8eeb-0eb92cc89f20","uuid":"ded192ba-27dd-490f-a2ec-1747afff065b"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_013dKrbBjLnPSFPthexhXnCX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01KAD3HALNnvvkTb8SisZsoW","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"C:\\Users\\Jyue\\Documents\\1-projects\\Software Projects\\pelangi-website\\site\\src\\components\\Gallery.tsx","old_string":"        <div\n          ref={scrollRef}\n          className=\"flex gap-4 overflow-x-auto scrollbar-hide pb-4 px-4 md:px-0 snap-x snap-mandatory\"\n          style={{ scrollbarWidth: 'none', msOverflowStyle: 'none' }}\n        >\n          {children}\n        </div>","new_string":"        <div\n          ref={scrollRef}\n          className=\"flex gap-4 overflow-x-auto scrollbar-hide pb-4 px-4 md:px-0 snap-x snap-mandatory carousel-scroll-container\"\n          style={{ scrollbarWidth: 'none', msOverflowStyle: 'none' }}\n        >\n          {children}\n        </div>"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1684,"cache_read_input_tokens":68016,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1684},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"68830e82-fc2d-45a4-8eeb-0eb92cc89f20","uuid":"ed50087d-8918-433b-900d-108cad2e1e75"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KAD3HALNnvvkTb8SisZsoW","type":"tool_result","content":"The file C:\\Users\\Jyue\\Documents\\1-projects\\Software Projects\\pelangi-website\\site\\src\\components\\Gallery.tsx has been updated successfully."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"68830e82-fc2d-45a4-8eeb-0eb92cc89f20","uuid":"ae1094d3-94bf-4571-b009-64a6e899d4c6","timestamp":"2026-04-14T05:03:14.186Z","tool_use_result":{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\Jyue\\Documents\\1-projects\\Software Projects\\pelangi-website\\site\\src\\components\\Gallery.tsx","oldString":"        <div\n          ref={scrollRef}\n          className=\"flex gap-4 overflow-x-auto scrollbar-hide pb-4 px-4 md:px-0 snap-x snap-mandatory\"\n          style={{ scrollbarWidth: 'none', msOverflowStyle: 'none' }}\n        >\n          {children}\n        </div>","newString":"        <div\n          ref={scrollRef}\n          className=\"flex gap-4 overflow-x-auto scrollbar-hide pb-4 px-4 md:px-0 snap-x snap-mandatory carousel-scroll-container\"\n          style={{ scrollbarWidth: 'none', msOverflowStyle: 'none' }}\n        >\n          {children}\n        </div>","originalFile":"\"use client\";\n\nimport { useState, useRef, useEffect, useCallback } from \"react\";\nimport Image from \"next/image\";\n\nfunction handleActivate(callback: () => void) {\n  return {\n    onClick: callback,\n    onKeyDown: (e: React.KeyboardEvent) => {\n      if (e.key === \"Enter\" || e.key === \" \") {\n        e.preventDefault();\n        callback();\n      }\n    },\n  };\n}\n\nexport default function Gallery() {\n  const [selectedImage, setSelectedImage] = useState<string | null>(null);\n  const [activeModal, setActiveModal] = useState<string | null>(null);\n  const [lightboxImages, setLightboxImages] = useState<string[]>([]);\n  const lightboxCloseRef = useRef<HTMLButtonElement>(null);\n  const modalCloseRef = useRef<HTMLButtonElement>(null);\n  const triggerRef = useRef<HTMLElement | null>(null);\n\n  const openLightbox = (src: string, images: string[]) => {\n    triggerRef.current = document.activeElement as HTMLElement;\n    setLightboxImages(images);\n    setSelectedImage(src);\n  };\n\n  const closeLightbox = useCallback(() => {\n    setSelectedImage(null);\n    setLightboxImages([]);\n    triggerRef.current?.focus();\n  }, []);\n\n  const closeModal = useCallback(() => {\n    setActiveModal(null);\n    triggerRef.current?.focus();\n  }, []);\n\n  const navigateLightbox = useCallback((direction: 'prev' | 'next') => {\n    setSelectedImage((prev) => {\n      if (!prev || lightboxImages.length === 0) return prev;\n      const currentIndex = lightboxImages.indexOf(prev);\n      if (currentIndex === -1) return prev;\n      const newIndex = direction === 'prev'\n        ? (currentIndex - 1 + lightboxImages.length) % lightboxImages.length\n        : (currentIndex + 1) % lightboxImages.length;\n      return lightboxImages[newIndex];\n    });\n  }, [lightboxImages]);\n\n  // Lightbox keyboard: Escape, ArrowLeft, ArrowRight\n  useEffect(() => {\n    if (!selectedImage) return;\n    // Focus close button when lightbox opens\n    lightboxCloseRef.current?.focus();\n\n    function handleKeyDown(e: KeyboardEvent) {\n      if (e.key === \"Escape\") {\n        closeLightbox();\n      } else if (e.key === \"ArrowLeft\") {\n        e.preventDefault();\n        navigateLightbox('prev');\n      } else if (e.key === \"ArrowRight\") {\n        e.preventDefault();\n        navigateLightbox('next');\n      }\n    }\n    document.addEventListener(\"keydown\", handleKeyDown);\n    return () => document.removeEventListener(\"keydown\", handleKeyDown);\n  }, [selectedImage, closeLightbox, navigateLightbox]);\n\n  // Modal keyboard: Escape to close\n  useEffect(() => {\n    if (!activeModal) return;\n    modalCloseRef.current?.focus();\n\n    function handleKeyDown(e: KeyboardEvent) {\n      if (e.key === \"Escape\") {\n        closeModal();\n      }\n    }\n    document.addEventListener(\"keydown\", handleKeyDown);\n    return () => document.removeEventListener(\"keydown\", handleKeyDown);\n  }, [activeModal, closeModal]);\n\n  // Hostel photos - best shots\n  const hostelPhotos = [\n    { src: \"/images/living-room.jpeg\", alt: \"Cozy common area and living room at Pelangi Capsule Hostel Johor Bahru\" },\n    { src: \"/images/capsule-1.webp\", alt: \"Japanese-style capsule pod interior with privacy features at budget hostel JB\" },\n    { src: \"/images/entrance.jpeg\", alt: \"Welcoming entrance of Pelangi Capsule Hostel in Taman Pelangi\" },\n    { src: \"/images/exterior.JPG\", alt: \"Pelangi Capsule Hostel building exterior in Johor Bahru Malaysia\" },\n    { src: \"/images/capsule-2.webp\", alt: \"Comfortable premium mattress in affordable hostel pod near Singapore\" },\n    { src: \"/images/toilet.jpg\", alt: \"Clean private bathroom with hot shower at Pelangi Hostel JB\" },\n    { src: \"/images/facility-heater.jpg\", alt: \"24/7 hot water heater facility at budget accommodation Johor Bahru\" },\n    { src: \"/images/sink.jpg\", alt: \"Washing and sink area at Pelangi Capsule Hostel\" },\n    { src: \"/images/capsule-3.webp\", alt: \"Capsule pod amenities including USB charging and ventilation\" },\n    { src: \"/images/facility-shoes-rack.jpg\", alt: \"Organized shoe storage at clean hostel in Taman Pelangi JB\" },\n  ];\n\n  // Guest photos - social proof\n  const guestPhotos = Array.from({ length: 20 }, (_, i) => ({\n    src: `/images/guests/guest-${i + 1}.jpg`,\n    alt: `Happy guest enjoying their stay at Pelangi Capsule Hostel Johor Bahru - photo ${i + 1}`,\n  }));\n\n  // Tourist destinations\n  const destinations = [\n    { src: \"/images/destinations/tioman-island.jpg\", name: \"Tioman Island\", distance: \"4 hours\" },\n    { src: \"/images/destinations/singapore.jpg\", name: \"Singapore\", distance: \"30 min\" },\n    { src: \"/images/destinations/jewel.jpg\", name: \"Jewel Changi\", distance: \"45 min\" },\n    { src: \"/images/destinations/garden-by-the-bay.jpg\", name: \"Gardens by the Bay\", distance: \"1 hour\" },\n    { src: \"/images/destinations/melaka.jpg\", name: \"Melaka\", distance: \"3 hours\" },\n    { src: \"/images/destinations/tanjung-piai-nationa.jpg\", name: \"Tanjung Piai\", distance: \"1.5 hours\" },\n  ];\n\n  const ScrollSection = ({\n    title,\n    subtitle,\n    children,\n    onSeeAll,\n    id\n  }: {\n    title: string;\n    subtitle: string;\n    children: React.ReactNode;\n    onSeeAll?: () => void;\n    id?: string;\n  }) => {\n    const scrollRef = useRef<HTMLDivElement>(null);\n\n    const scroll = (direction: 'left' | 'right') => {\n      if (scrollRef.current) {\n        const scrollAmount = 320;\n        const prefersReducedMotion = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\n        scrollRef.current.scrollBy({\n          left: direction === 'left' ? -scrollAmount : scrollAmount,\n          behavior: prefersReducedMotion ? 'auto' : 'smooth'\n        });\n      }\n    };\n\n    return (\n      <div id={id} className=\"mb-16 scroll-mt-24\">\n        <div className=\"flex items-end justify-between mb-6 px-4 md:px-0\">\n          <div>\n            <h3 className=\"font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl font-medium text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100\">{title}</h3>\n            <p className=\"text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400 text-sm mt-1\">{subtitle}</p>\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n            {onSeeAll && (\n              <button\n                onClick={onSeeAll}\n                className=\"min-h-6 inline-flex items-center text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 hover:text-amber-800 dark:hover:text-amber-300 font-medium text-sm mr-4 cursor-pointer\"\n              >\n                See All →\n              </button>\n            )}\n            <button\n              onClick={() => scroll('left')}\n              className=\"w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-white dark:bg-stone-800 shadow-md flex items-center justify-center\n                       hover:bg-stone-50 dark:hover:bg-stone-700 transition-colors cursor-pointer\"\n              aria-label=\"Previous image\"\n            >\n              <svg className=\"w-5 h-5 text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-300\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                <path strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\" strokeWidth={2} d=\"M15 19l-7-7 7-7\" />\n              </svg>\n            </button>\n            <button\n              onClick={() => scroll('right')}\n              className=\"w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-white dark:bg-stone-800 shadow-md flex items-center justify-center\n                       hover:bg-stone-50 dark:hover:bg-stone-700 transition-colors cursor-pointer\"\n              aria-label=\"Next image\"\n            >\n              <svg className=\"w-5 h-5 text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-300\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                <path strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\" strokeWidth={2} d=\"M9 5l7 7-7 7\" />\n              </svg>\n            </button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div\n          ref={scrollRef}\n          className=\"flex gap-4 overflow-x-auto scrollbar-hide pb-4 px-4 md:px-0 snap-x snap-mandatory\"\n          style={{ scrollbarWidth: 'none', msOverflowStyle: 'none' }}\n        >\n          {children}\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    );\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <section id=\"gallery\" className=\"section-padding bg-stone-50 dark:bg-stone-950\">\n      <div className=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto\">\n        {/* Header */}\n        <div className=\"text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-14 px-4\">\n          <p className=\"section-label\">Gallery</p>\n          <h2 className=\"section-heading mb-6\">Photo Gallery</h2>\n          <p className=\"text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400 text-lg leading-relaxed\">\n            Browse through our hostel, see happy guests, and discover adventures waiting for you.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n        {/* Section 1: Our Hostel */}\n        <ScrollSection\n          title=\"Our Hostel\"\n          subtitle=\"Capsules, facilities, and common areas\"\n        >\n          {hostelPhotos.map((photo, index) => (\n            <div\n              key={index}\n              role=\"button\"\n              tabIndex={0}\n              aria-label={`View photo: ${photo.alt}`}\n              className=\"shrink-0 w-72 h-48 md:w-80 md:h-56 relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden\n                       cursor-pointer group snap-start focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-amber-700\"\n              {...handleActivate(() => openLightbox(photo.src, hostelPhotos.map(p => p.src)))}\n            >\n              <Image\n                src={photo.src}\n                alt={photo.alt}\n                fill\n                sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 288px, 320px\"\n                className=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-110\"\n              />\n              <div className=\"absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-t from-stone-900/60 via-transparent to-transparent\n                            opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 group-focus-within:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300\" />\n              <div className=\"absolute bottom-3 left-3 text-white opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 group-focus-within:opacity-100\n                            transition-opacity duration-300\">\n                <p className=\"text-sm font-medium\">{photo.alt}</p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          ))}\n        </ScrollSection>\n\n        {/* Section 2: Happy Guests */}\n        <ScrollSection\n          id=\"community\"\n          title=\"Guest Photos\"\n          subtitle=\"Real moments from our community\"\n          onSeeAll={() => { triggerRef.current = document.activeElement as HTMLElement; setActiveModal('guests'); }}\n        >\n          {guestPhotos.slice(0, 12).map((photo, index) => (\n            <div\n              key={index}\n              role=\"button\"\n              tabIndex={0}\n              aria-label={`View guest photo ${index + 1}`}\n              className=\"shrink-0 w-40 h-40 md:w-48 md:h-48 relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden\n                       cursor-pointer group snap-start focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-amber-700\"\n              {...handleActivate(() => openLightbox(photo.src, guestPhotos.map(p => p.src)))}\n            >\n              <Image\n                src={photo.src}\n                alt={photo.alt}\n                fill\n                sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 160px, 192px\"\n                className=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-110\"\n              />\n              <div className=\"absolute inset-0 bg-stone-900/0 group-hover:bg-stone-900/20 transition-colors\" />\n            </div>\n          ))}\n          {/* See more card */}\n          <div\n            role=\"button\"\n            tabIndex={0}\n            aria-label={`View all ${guestPhotos.length} guest photos`}\n            className=\"shrink-0 w-40 h-40 md:w-48 md:h-48 relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden\n                     cursor-pointer group snap-start bg-amber-100 dark:bg-amber-900/30 flex items-center justify-center\n                     focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-amber-700\"\n            {...handleActivate(() => { triggerRef.current = document.activeElement as HTMLElement; setActiveModal('guests'); })}\n          >\n            <div className=\"text-center\">\n              <div className=\"text-3xl font-display font-medium text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400\">+{guestPhotos.length - 12}</div>\n              <div className=\"text-sm text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 mt-1\">more photos</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </ScrollSection>\n\n        {/* Section 3: Explore from JB */}\n        <ScrollSection\n          title=\"Adventures Await\"\n          subtitle=\"Amazing destinations within reach\"\n        >\n          {destinations.map((dest, index) => (\n            <div\n              key={index}\n              role=\"button\"\n              tabIndex={0}\n              aria-label={`View photo: ${dest.name}`}\n              className=\"shrink-0 w-64 md:w-72 relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden\n                       cursor-pointer group snap-start focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-amber-700\"\n              {...handleActivate(() => openLightbox(dest.src, destinations.map(d => d.src)))}\n            >\n              <div className=\"relative h-44 md:h-52\">\n                <Image\n                  src={dest.src}\n                  alt={dest.name}\n                  fill\n                  sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 256px, 288px\"\n                  className=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-110\"\n                />\n                <div className=\"absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-t from-stone-900/80 via-stone-900/20 to-transparent\" />\n              </div>\n              <div className=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 p-4 text-white\">\n                <h4 className=\"font-semibold text-lg\">{dest.name}</h4>\n                <p className=\"text-sm text-stone-300 flex items-center gap-1 mt-1\">\n                  <svg className=\"w-4 h-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                    <path strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\" strokeWidth={2}\n                      d=\"M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\" />\n                  </svg>\n                  {dest.distance} from hostel\n                </p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          ))}\n        </ScrollSection>\n\n        {/* Video Section */}\n        <div className=\"mt-8 px-4 md:px-0\">\n          <div className=\"text-center mb-8\">\n            <p className=\"text-xs tracking-widest uppercase text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400 mb-2\">Virtual Tour</p>\n            <h3 className=\"font-display text-2xl font-medium text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100\">\n              Watch Our Check-in Guide\n            </h3>\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"relative max-w-3xl mx-auto aspect-video rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl\">\n            <iframe\n              src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/6Ux11oBZaQQ?cc_load_policy=1&cc_lang_pref=en\"\n              title=\"Pelangi Capsule Hostel Check-in Guide\"\n              allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\"\n              allowFullScreen\n              className=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full\"\n            />\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      {/* Lightbox */}\n      {selectedImage && (\n        <div\n          role=\"dialog\"\n          aria-label=\"Image lightbox\"\n          aria-modal=\"true\"\n          className=\"fixed inset-0 z-50 bg-stone-900/95 backdrop-blur-xs flex items-center justify-center p-4\"\n          onClick={() => closeLightbox()}\n        >\n          <button\n            ref={lightboxCloseRef}\n            className=\"absolute top-6 right-6 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-white/10 flex items-center justify-center\n                     text-white hover:bg-white/20 transition-colors cursor-pointer\"\n            onClick={() => closeLightbox()}\n            aria-label=\"Close lightbox (Escape)\"\n          >\n            <svg className=\"w-6 h-6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n              <path strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\" strokeWidth={1.5} d=\"M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12\" />\n            </svg>\n          </button>\n          {lightboxImages.length > 1 && (\n            <button\n              className=\"absolute left-4 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-white/10 flex items-center justify-center\n                       text-white hover:bg-white/20 transition-colors cursor-pointer z-10\"\n              onClick={(e) => { e.stopPropagation(); navigateLightbox('prev'); }}\n              aria-label=\"Previous image (Left arrow)\"\n            >\n              <svg className=\"w-6 h-6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                <path strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\" strokeWidth={2} d=\"M15 19l-7-7 7-7\" />\n              </svg>\n            </button>\n          )}\n          <div className=\"relative w-full max-w-5xl h-[80vh]\" onClick={(e) => e.stopPropagation()}>\n            <Image\n              src={selectedImage}\n              alt=\"Pelangi Capsule Hostel Johor Bahru - Gallery photo view\"\n              fill\n              sizes=\"100vw\"\n              className=\"object-contain\"\n            />\n          </div>\n          {lightboxImages.length > 1 && (\n            <button\n              className=\"absolute right-4 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-white/10 flex items-center justify-center\n                       text-white hover:bg-white/20 transition-colors cursor-pointer z-10\"\n              onClick={(e) => { e.stopPropagation(); navigateLightbox('next'); }}\n              aria-label=\"Next image (Right arrow)\"\n            >\n              <svg className=\"w-6 h-6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                <path strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\" strokeWidth={2} d=\"M9 5l7 7-7 7\" />\n              </svg>\n            </button>\n          )}\n        </div>\n      )}\n\n      {/* All Guests Modal */}\n      {activeModal === 'guests' && (\n        <div\n          role=\"dialog\"\n          aria-label=\"All guest photos\"\n          aria-modal=\"true\"\n          className=\"fixed inset-0 z-50 bg-stone-900/95 backdrop-blur-xs overflow-y-auto\"\n          onClick={() => closeModal()}\n        >\n          <div className=\"min-h-screen p-4 md:p-8\">\n            <div className=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto\">\n              <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-8 sticky top-0 bg-stone-900/80 backdrop-blur-xs py-4 -mx-4 px-4\">\n                <div>\n                  <h3 className=\"text-2xl font-display font-medium text-white\">Guest Photos</h3>\n                  <p className=\"text-stone-400 text-sm\">{guestPhotos.length} photos from our community</p>\n                </div>\n                <button\n                  ref={modalCloseRef}\n                  className=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-white/10 flex items-center justify-center\n                           text-white hover:bg-white/20 transition-colors cursor-pointer\"\n                  onClick={() => closeModal()}\n                  aria-label=\"Close guest photos gallery (Escape)\"\n                >\n                  <svg className=\"w-6 h-6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                    <path strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\" strokeWidth={1.5} d=\"M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12\" />\n                  </svg>\n                </button>\n              </div>\n              <div\n                className=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-3\"\n                onClick={(e) => e.stopPropagation()}\n              >\n                {guestPhotos.map((photo, index) => (\n                  <div\n                    key={index}\n                    role=\"button\"\n                    tabIndex={0}\n                    aria-label={`View guest photo ${index + 1}`}\n                    className=\"relative aspect-square rounded-xl overflow-hidden cursor-pointer group\n                             focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-amber-700\"\n                    {...handleActivate(() => {\n                      closeModal();\n                      openLightbox(photo.src, guestPhotos.map(p => p.src));\n                    })}\n                  >\n                    <Image\n                      src={photo.src}\n                      alt={photo.alt}\n                      fill\n                      sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 50vw, (max-width: 1024px) 25vw, 20vw\"\n                      className=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-110\"\n                    />\n                    <div className=\"absolute inset-0 bg-stone-900/0 group-hover:bg-stone-900/30 transition-colors\" />\n                  </div>\n                ))}\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      )}\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":183,"oldLines":7,"newStart":183,"newLines":7,"lines":["         </div>","         <div","           ref={scrollRef}","-          className=\"flex gap-4 overflow-x-auto scrollbar-hide pb-4 px-4 md:px-0 snap-x snap-mandatory\"","+          className=\"flex gap-4 overflow-x-auto scrollbar-hide pb-4 px-4 md:px-0 snap-x snap-mandatory carousel-scroll-container\"","           style={{ scrollbarWidth: 'none', msOverflowStyle: 'none' }}","         >","           {children}"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false}}
